{"answer": "1. 市区铅酸电池蓄电池巡检综合单价为18.24元/组·次。[1]  \n2. 该价格对应项目编码WH21108001，适用于市区场景。[1]  \n3. 工作内容包括检查表面、电压测试、紧固螺丝等。[1]  \n4. 人工费占比为11.40元，含企业管理费与利润。[1]  \n5. 不同地形（平原、山区）单价不同，需区分使用。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0028", "question": "市区铅酸电池蓄电池巡检的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 37.43354989438758, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "516321b662bd8c85c187ac85", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_fdafff46655a8c83f0ac", "block_index": 233, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 233, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 83, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第234页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_d074b0dd35f18a156a8c", "page_number": 234, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_2985f8cd0b34f2a47e0d", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_2985f8cd0b34f2a47e0d", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第234页"], "section_title": "第234页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_fdafff46655a8c83f0ac"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"