{"answer": "1. 平原、丘陵地区开关电源设备巡检的技工人工费为13.68元。[1]  \n2. 该费用对应项目编码WH21107002，计量单位为台·次。[1]  \n3. 综合单价为21.89元，其中技工人工费占13.68元。[1]  \n4. 巡检工作内容包括检查清洁外观、紧固连接等。[1]  \n5. 此标准依据《电信基础设施维护规程》第233页。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0030", "question": "平原、丘陵地区开关电源设备巡检的技工人工费是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 42.08632004214708, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "25680e892d4e58e2a06452dc", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f5e490febd8563158a8b", "block_index": 232, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 232, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 57, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第233页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_2985f8cd0b34f2a47e0d", "page_number": 233, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_d2f2f59cf300091e35e6", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_d2f2f59cf300091e35e6", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第233页"], "section_title": "第233页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_f5e490febd8563158a8b"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b