{"answer": "1. 水泥帮桩的消耗量为1.29根。[1]  \n2. 该数据来源于电信基础设施维护规程第206页表10.2.2.16。[1]  \n3. 消耗量单位为“根”，适用于水泥帮桩安装作业。[1]  \n4. 与木帮桩（消耗量0.96根）相比，水泥帮桩用量更高。[1]  \n5. 该数值为综合单价中的材料消耗标准。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0034", "question": "水泥帮桩的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 21.343878825348245, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "7076649a12d6085d53f38c54", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b5dad98616197be8f8b4", "block_index": 205, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 205, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 80, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第206页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_a1611f078dc4cee1d350", "page_number": 206, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_958fa8a5ea0f32f89ee7", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_958fa8a5ea0f32f89ee7", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第206页"], "section_title": "第206页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_b5dad98616197be8f8b4"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title"