{"answer": "1. 直埋式安装电杆地线的消耗量为0.24条。[2]  \n2. 该数据来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第192页表10.2.2.6。[2]  \n3. 消耗量单位为“条”，适用于直埋式地线安装作业。[2]  \n4. 不同地线类型（如拉线式、延伸式）消耗量不同。[2]  \n5. 该标准适用于合同约定维护周期内的实际发生次数计算。[4]", "case_id": "p6s-0036", "question": "直埋式安装电杆地线的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 35.7277120096954, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "c075dc68d46c245c3f7a221f", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f40c6ac13c6a5ca85ad1", "block_index": 207, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 207, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 56, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第208页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_4f2b1c13cecd5671e00d", "page_number": 208, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_21893aedf8c3d9ca533c", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_21893aedf8c3d9ca533c", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第208页"], "section_title": "第208页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_f40c6ac13c6a5ca85ad1"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "