0 WH33120001 更换整流模块 50A 以下 365.65 248.06 67.97 49.61 消耗量 2.18 0.00 WH33120002 100A 以下 470.12 318.94 87.39 63.79 2.80 0.00 WH33120003 100A 以上 607.23 411.96 112.88 82.39 3.61 0.00"}, "keyword_score": 0.35984399136163847, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.35984399136163847, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.5080180114992203, "score": 0.5080180114992203, "semantic_score": 0.5715211629867554}]}
{"answer": "1. 温湿、烟感、水浸监控单元的消耗量为0.50点。[1]  \n2. 该数据来源于表10.3.3.28及表10.4.3.11，均显示相同数值。[2]  \n3. 消耗量单位为“点”，适用于安装调试作业。[1]  \n4. 与动力监控、配电监控单元的1.00点不同，此单元消耗量较低。[1]  \n5. 该信息在多个页面中一致确认，可信度高。[1][2]", "case_id": "p6s-0044", "question": "温湿、烟感、水浸监控单元的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 39.84590100542042, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "1e0ecc00da25d8f309dda9d2", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_a47c831b3ea6e23e51a7", "block_index": 284, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 284, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 65, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第285页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_29cf0bf514119eeccb11", "page_number": 285, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_2018c554db05887f3508", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_2018c554db05887f3508", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第285页"], "section_title": "第285页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_a47c831b3ea6e23e51a7"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tena