{"answer": "1. 吊顶式机房通用空调的消耗量为1.45台·次。[1]  \n2. 该数据来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第311页表10.4.3.10。[1]  \n3. 消耗量单位为“台·次”，适用于安装与调试作业。[1]  \n4. 与壁挂式（1.20）和立式（1.75）相比，吊顶式消耗量居中。[1]  \n5. 信息一致出现在第284页相同表格中。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0048", "question": "吊顶式机房通用空调的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 43.98093240031322, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "a59c4ba1c34979638feb45c2", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_9648c79bddcd7715e053", "block_index": 310, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 310, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 56, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第311页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_3b48d9bd4e719f8b9715", "page_number": 311, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_ba29ad9a5ed8f788f5b1", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_ba29ad9a5ed8f788f5b1", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第311页"], "section_title": "第311页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_9648c79bddcd7715e053"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c