pproved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_b8e6331b040f6570176d", "page_number": 181, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_53421ac01845ebf21899", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_53421ac01845ebf21899", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第181页"], "section_title": "第181页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_7e1b48b77a27e1a5ba8c"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第181页 页码：181 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 175 表10.2.1.9 WH11009 管道光缆日常检修 工作内容：人孔内抽水，重新绑扎、整理光缆在人孔内的走线排列，光缆除垢，按需加套塑料管，整治固定接头盒、预留光缆，补、换光缆挂牌等。 计量单位：千米²次 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH11009001 管道光缆日常检修 515.90 350.00 95.90 70.00 消耗量 2.00 2.00 注：管廊内敷设的光缆视同管道光缆，按管道光缆条目取费。 表10.2.1.10 WH11010 通信管道日常检修 工作内容：及时更换井盖、井框，井号油漆，描字，清理井内淤泥、杂物；整治人孔内的托架、托板和标志；清洗管孔、人孔内抽水；人手孔井面杂物清理等。 计量单位：千米²次 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH11010001 通信管道日常检修 515.90 350.00 95.90 70.00 消耗量 2.00 2.00 注：管廊视同通信管道，按通信管道条目取费。"}, "keyword_score": 0.6675312037247674, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.6675312037247674, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.6776676794825471, "score": 0.6776676794825471, "semantic_score": 0.6820118833787384}, {"bm25_score": 24.47672357897592, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "5396ea9eec4125daa7f95045", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_a20372649c831c0ba910", "block_index": 172, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 172, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 61, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第173页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_0448465a89bfa194f94a", "page_number": 173, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_385d2fe67eafb43e9ff7", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_385d2fe67eafb43e9ff7", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第173页"], "section_title": "第173页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_a20372649c831c0ba910"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第173页 页码：173 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 167 10.2 信息通信光缆线路维护工作量清单项目综合单价指标 10.2.1 信息通信光缆线路日常维护项目综合单价指标 表10.2.1.1 WH11101 架空光缆线路徒步巡回 工作内容：徒步沿线巡回，检查拉线是否生锈、电杆是否正立、有无塌方、吊线垂度是否符合要求、挂钩有无脱落、宣传牌、标志牌、警示牌是否歪斜或缺漏、 沿线重点部位保护是否到位、沿线有无外力施工影响线路安全等；做好巡查记录，并将发现的问题及时上报等。 计量单位：千米²次 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH11001001 架空光缆线路徒步巡回 平原 66.01 44.79 12.27 8.96 消耗量 0.39 — WH11001002 丘陵、城市 79.22 53.74 14.73 10.75 0.47 — WH11001003 山区 99.02 67.18 18.41 13.44 0.59 —"}, "keyword_score": 0.5261181448569031, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.5261181448569031, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.6494394855102935, "score": 0.6494394855102935, "semantic_score": 0.7022914886474609}]}
{"answer": "1. 山区直埋光缆日常检修的利润为25.45元/千米²次。[1]  \n2. 该利润包含在综合单价136.92元中，对应山区作业标准。[1]  \n3. 利润项基于人工费与企业管理费后计算得出。[1]  \n4. 项目编码为WH11008003，适用于山区地形。[1]  \n5. 计量单位为千米²次，按实际维护次数计列。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0053", "question": "山区直埋光缆日常检修的利润是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 41.499542932065005, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "cbbeb4430a68f9c32c878010", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_7d231b902b7ec64a57c7", "block_index": 179, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 179, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 57, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第180页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_53421ac01845ebf21899", "page_number": 180, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_8f1361fec987419f95a5", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_8f1361fec987419f95a5", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第180页"], "section_title": "第180页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_7d231b902b7ec64a57c7"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "defau