{"answer": "1. 铁路与架空通信线路的最小垂直净距为3.0米。[1]  \n2. 该数据出自《电信基础设施维护规程》第343页表D.0.2。[1]  \n3. 此标准适用于架空通信线路与铁路轨面之间的垂直距离要求。[1]  \n4. 若线路有特殊防护，可参考更高数值7.5米。[1]  \n5. 该规范为行业通用技术标准，需严格遵守。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0059", "question": "铁路与架空通信线路的最小垂直净距是多少米？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 73.76065128883216, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "d8dfa78cb9362f0d69cd659c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b6f247a411f750a786e9", "block_index": 342, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 342, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 60, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9fb82b1766911b54a376", "page_number": 343, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "section_title": "第343页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_b6f247a411f750a786e9"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "