{"answer": "1. WH34101应急发电的计量单位为“次”。[1]  \n2. 该编码对应的工作内容包括器材准备、发电及记录时间等。[1]  \n3. “次”作为计量单位适用于小型局站有线设备维护项目。[1]  \n4. 与类似项目如WH24101计量单位一致，均为“次”。[2]  \n5. 其他发电相关项目如巡检、检修则使用“台·次”。[3][4]", "case_id": "p6s-0061", "question": "WH34101 应急发电的计量单位是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 25.008422548204283, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "620acaeddf52599dd4ae377d", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_cdf191e21d9550d18339", "block_index": 322, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 322, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 71, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第323页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_d8744a8caa9d5ef37d0c", "page_number": 323, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_474843c4c414b65248cf", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_474843c4c414b65248cf", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第323页"], "section_title": "第323页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_cdf191e21d9550d18339"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002