{"answer": "1. 杆根加固包含立新杆后进行回填夯实操作。[1]  \n2. 需根据土质类别安装卡盘或底盘以加固杆根。[1]  \n3. 对于特殊土质，需加装帮桩并缠扎固定（涂油）。[1]  \n4. 杆根加固应配合挖坑、安装、回填夯土等步骤完成。[1]  \n5. 作业中需确保杆根稳固，防止倾斜或下沉。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0070", "question": "更换电杆时，立新杆和杆根加固的步骤中，杆根加固具体包含什么操作？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 41.12905070283397, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "74207e88e3fcb93a6e60028b", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_64d79e1cf185aff79478", "block_index": 127, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 127, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 104, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第128页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_1601eacdb0854f3bb8de", "page_number": 128, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_2bc86a72dc850c513de7", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_2bc86a72dc850c513de7", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第128页"], "section_title": "第128页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_64d79e1cf185aff79478"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "tex