{"answer": "1. 安装吊线保护装置时需安装吊线绝缘保护套管。[1]  \n2. 需进行绑扎固定操作以确保装置稳固。[2]  \n3. 工作内容包括安装保护装置及后续绑扎。[4]  \n4. 旧套管需先拆除，再安装新保护套管。[1]  \n5. 具体部件为吊线绝缘保护套管。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0071", "question": "安装吊线保护装置时，需要安装什么具体部件？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 32.570725976187546, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "04ba16cd3e253aae818ddccd", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_4883dc4b8328b0108bd9", "block_index": 206, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 206, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 39, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第207页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_21893aedf8c3d9ca533c", "page_number": 207, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_a1611f078dc4cee1d350", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_a1611f078dc4cee1d350", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第207页"], "section_title": "第207页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_4883dc4b8328b0108bd9"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第207页 