{"answer": "1. 敷设镀锌钢管管道时，钢管规格未在上下文中明确列出。[2]  \n2. 项目编码WH12023涉及敷设镀锌钢管管道，但未说明具体规格参数。[1]  \n3. 维护作业包含接钢管、铺钢管等，但未提及钢管尺寸或型号。[1]  \n4. 钢管规格需依据实际工程设计或合同约定确定。[2]  \n5. 当前检索内容中无明确的钢管规格参数信息。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0072", "question": "敷设镀锌钢管管道时，钢管的规格参数是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 40.45117542315302, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "1b56cd11de85631a94e7765d", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_94c7f04a9208cb1ee4e5", "block_index": 212, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 212, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 113, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第213页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_8fce1c7e6e3df0b32b59", "page_number": 213, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_874fc507eefea0002908", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_874fc507eefea0002908", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第213页"], "section_title": "第213页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_94c7f04a9208cb1ee4e5"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d8690