{"answer": "1. 维护分项作业工作量清单与计价表编号为表—04。[1]  \n2. 在维护预算表格中，该表编号为表—03。[2]  \n3. 该表用于列明维护项目名称、工作量及金额等信息。[4]  \n4. 表—04适用于维护项目费用结算场景。[1]  \n5. 编号依据来自《电信基础设施维护规程》第93页规定。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0074", "question": "维护分项作业工作量清单与计价表的编号是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 51.48012225132682, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "ee399b4631c332fa2e834a3b", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_9980ea68b8be51f7745c", "block_index": 92, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 92, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 63, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第93页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_853929c805f468b97847", "page_number": 93, "page_warning_codes": ["semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_dd90f27a006554336bad", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_dd90f27a006554336bad", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第93页"], "section_title": "第93页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_9980ea68b8be51f7745c"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "t