{"answer": "1. 基础回弹均值必须符合设计要求。[1]  \n2. 该要求在塔基维护周期中明确提及。[1]  \n3. 维护周期为半年，需进行核对。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0079", "question": "基础回弹均值必须符合什么要求？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 43.481255635982464, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "14596d4e75ad163dd5bfc2e2", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_fbb60ba460fb94404584", "block_index": 52, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 52, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 42, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第53页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_c554ddc5bd3cb22329d0", "page_number": 53, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_f127cc796b81fd875b82", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_f127cc796b81fd875b82", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第53页"], "section_title": "第53页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_fbb60ba460fb94404584"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第53页 页码：53 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 47 网络质量测 试 C10T 测 试 按需 拨打次数、拨打区域符合规范要求 5.6.2.6 塔桅机房日常维护内容和要求见表5.6.2.6。 表5.6.2.6 塔桅机房日常维护内容和要求表 维护对象 维护周期 维护内容和要求 铁塔 基础 数据 半年 1.测量塔体经纬度、塔体和平台高度，与原基础数据进行核对。 塔基 基础 季度 1. 铁塔基础表面无蜂窝、麻面、无结构裂缝，基础钢筋无外露。塔脚包封良 好、地脚螺栓无外露现象。 2.地面回填土平整无开裂、下沉。 3.一体化塔房地梁无断裂、开裂、错位、滑移、异常沉降、不均匀沉降现象。 半埋式、全埋式地梁检查覆土完整。 4.楼面塔所在建筑结构受力构件（如墙体、墙面等）无裂纹、变形在允许范围 内。 5.塔脚地脚螺栓、螺母规格型号正确，无松动、缺损，防腐防盗措施有效。补 装更换缺损、问题螺栓，修复防腐防盗设施。 6.简单处理无潜在危害的裂缝。无法处理上报运营企业处理。 半年 基础回弹均值必须符合设计要求。"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.7090083111514673, "score": 0.7090083111514673, "semantic_score": 0.5842975873592392}, {"bm25_score": 8.468529925014174, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "68a1c1448a91e95c36a18aa3", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b", "block_index": 248, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 248, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 84, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_f226dbe905d18319b912", "page_number": 249, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "section_title": "第249页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基