{"answer": "1. WH12014003石笼的综合单价为1539.42元。[1]  \n2. 该单价适用于平原地区。[1]  \n3. 丘陵、城区需乘以1.2倍系数。[1]  \n4. 山区需乘以1.5倍系数。[1]  \n5. 单价包含人工、材料及管理费用。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0081", "question": "WH12014003 石笼的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 18.48801818098574, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "f7cee66c5c29f23117e88696", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_12d614993a0e6f7bce6e", "block_index": 203, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 203, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 68, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第204页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_d7ee2eed487d68fcccc9", "page_number": 204, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_53caa5792f5387befd42", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_53caa5792f5387befd42", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第204页"], "section_title": "第204页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_12d614993a0e6f7bce6e"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "versi