2053ec18f1415e4912c510f", "id": "a8887b02ae32e4d4748ad264", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_062ea1989856843c56f3", "block_index": 44, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 44, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "ab72ce00c904f060e1a60edb2af37b98f35cb9464f510e1022e29c657a94cf99", "detected_codes": ["T9254"], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 6, "end_unit": 45, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0", "第45页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_5be764fc91f1af2aceae", "page_number": 45, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_afd2070e6dfb46370776", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_afd2070e6dfb46370776", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0", "第45页"], "section_title": "第45页", "source": "中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_062ea1989856843c56f3"], "source_path": "/app/data/中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0", "version_id": "v_ab72ce00c904f060"}, "text": "章节：中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0 > 第45页 页码：45 40 4.5. 运行环境要求 4.5.1. 供电及功耗要求 全光组网终端应支持本地交流供电方式，输入交流电压及其波动范围要求为：单相 220V，变化范围为10%，频率50Hz，变化范围为5%，线电压波形畸变率小于5%。设备在 此范围内应正常工作。 光网关最大功耗应小于24W，光路由最大功耗应小于16W。 在正常情况下，设备的金属外壳与电源线间的绝缘电阻应不小于50MΩ。 电源适配器应符合YD/T 983的EMC要求。电源适配器的MTBF时间应不小于50000小 时，输出端接口为标准圆形接口。 说明： ①本规范最大功耗对应WLAN规格为双频四流的全光组网终端，当WLAN规格超过 双频四流时，每增加两条空间流，最大功耗可放宽3W。； ②本规范最大功耗均设备本身功耗要求，若设备具有对外供电能力时（如光电混合缆 供电），对外供电的功率不计入终端最大功耗； 4.5.2. 环境要求 设备应在下表所列环境条件下正常工作： 表4-10 环境要求 温度（℃） 相对湿度（%） 大气压力（KPa） -5~40 10~95 86~106 4.5.3. 电磁干扰能力 除符合GB/T9254.1 外，还需符合GB/T 19286-2015《电信网络设备的电磁兼容性要 求及测量方法》的要求。 4.5.4. 设备本身产生的电磁干扰要求 除符合GB/T9254.1 外，还需符合GB/T 19286-2015《电信网络设备的电磁兼容性要 求及测量方法》的要求。"}, "keyword_score": 0.15281611570871617, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.15281611570871617, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.4265943893020328, "score": 0.4265943893020328, "semantic_score": 0.54392793512774}]}
{"answer": "1. 山区、2小时以下的应急发电综合单价为207.94元。[1]  \n2. 该价格包含人工费、企业管理费及利润。[1]  \n3. 工作内容包括器材准备、发电、恢复现场和记录时间。[1]  \n4. 与市区、平原地区相比，山区单价更高。[1]  \n5. 此标准依据《电信基础设施维护规程》第289页规定。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0083", "question": "山区、2小时以下的应急发电综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 44.50692899469721, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "5dde5ed6e53f62177672e78b", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_bb6d6dc18af5c409e7c4", "block_index": 288, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 288, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 71, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第289页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9d21c0981ae4c911f364", "page_number": 289, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_9c68d1625906abc73226", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_9c68d1625906abc73226", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第289页"], "section_title": "第289页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_bb6d6dc18af5c409e7c4"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text":