{"answer": "1. 故障抢修综合单价根据项目类型不同，分别为182.40元、156.86元等。[1][2]  \n2. 信息通信光缆线路故障抢通按“处”计价，管道类为1217.10元/处。[3]  \n3. 综合单价包含人工费、企业管理费及利润等构成。[1][2][3]  \n4. 不同作业场景（如机房、基站、光缆）对应不同单价标准。[1][2][3]  \n5. 具体单价需依据故障类型和作业地点确定。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0084", "question": "故障抢修的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 22.069209727153762, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "6d7a9e41a2a2b736a7746409", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_d80a61c301fa263f1b9a", "block_index": 323, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 323, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 39, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第324页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_add305aa36377afac8de", "page_number": 324, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_d8744a8caa9d5ef37d0c", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_d8744a8caa9d5ef37d0c", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第324页"], "section_title": "第324页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_d80a61c301fa263f1b9a"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_