{"answer": "1. 电费代缴的消耗量为1次/站·次。[1]  \n2. 该工作按“站·次”作为计量单位进行核算。[2]  \n3. 消耗量在维护作业清单中明确标注为“次”。[1]  \n4. 项目编码WH34103002对应电费代缴，消耗量为1.00。[1]  \n5. 与资产盘点、资源录入等同属其他工作类别。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0085", "question": "电费代缴的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 23.92563594780958, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "2ec236820167f2d1a720a4a9", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_5fd5907b9c0fa017cbd0", "block_index": 324, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 324, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 67, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第325页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_39b0e7e8df5128a4ae3c", "page_number": 325, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_add305aa36377afac8de", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_add305aa36377afac8de", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第325页"], "section_title": "第325页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_5fd5907b9c0fa017cbd0"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础