{"answer": "1. 入户光缆敷设应做到安全、牢固、隐蔽、美观。[3]  \n2. 施工后需用户签署完工确认单并记录光衰减值。[3]  \n3. 应按终端安装指导手册规范操作设备安装。[3]  \n4. 需综合考虑经济性、安全性及后期维护便捷性。[3]  \n5. 敷设过程须遵守装维作业安全操作规范。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0092", "question": "在室内场景下，如何操作入户光缆的敷设？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 20.382280560047583, "chunk": {"document_id": "5256824b6b72b3f03d9c7a2c", "id": "95ae763cde2f43aec2cb7d14", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_ff3587e548ae74b41572", "block_index": 13, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 13, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "dcf78195a87f01f45fc99b3af1c541f948a7cc8b6578168c0cb862cf9b620277", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 4, "end_unit": 139, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "第14页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_d7f4b86d134ef90dd651", "page_number": 14, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_bd01f7122688e3570478", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_bd01f7122688e3570478", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "第14页"], "section_title": "第14页", "source": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_ff3587e548ae74b41572"], "source_path": "/app/data/智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "version