{"answer": "1. 100kVA以下变压器专项检修人工费为47.88元。[1]  \n2. 该费用对应项目编码WH23120001。[1]  \n3. 综合单价中人工费占比明确列出。[1]  \n4. 适用于断电检修作业场景。[1]  \n5. 数据来源为《电信基础设施维护规程》第277页。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0098", "question": "100kVA以下变压器专项检修的人工费是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 53.898573971652866, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "647c44016cd2e8fabe51f5de", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b752c48e8d6ea8c40317", "block_index": 276, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 276, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 59, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第277页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_dc5f6d6b732b89158ebe", "page_number": 277, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_15cb5e40787da2f26b59", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_15cb5e40787da2f26b59", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第277页"], "section_title": "第277页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_b752c48e8d6ea8c40317"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电