{"answer": "1. 高铁隧道内布放光电混合缆，综合单价乘以系数1.5。[1]  \n2. 该调整适用于外径≤10mm及＞10mm的光电混合缆布放。[1]  \n3. 系数1.5仅针对高铁隧道内作业场景。[1]  \n4. 调整后单价包含人工、管理费及利润。[1]  \n5. 其他场景如管井、竖井等按系数1.3调整。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0101", "question": "在高铁隧道内布放光电混合缆时，应如何调整综合单价？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 69.9832642877543, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "e163f6cc6694b7fc57a30d7d", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_0c30b09f251d1c27af17", "block_index": 257, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 257, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 82, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第258页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_b8c4510bb2e45c4dc64a", "page_number": 258, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_2d7adb38285d396d648a", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_2d7adb38285d396d648a", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第258页"], "section_title": "第258页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_0c30b09f251d1c27af17"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", 