基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第224页 页码：224 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 218 10.2.4 信息通信光缆线路工程抢修及割接项目综合单价指标 表10.2.4.1 WH14001 故障抢通 工作内容：1、抢通准备：器材准备，人员准备； 2、抢通实施：障碍点查找，敷设应急光缆（材料费用另计），现场安全设施，障碍点处理；在用系统恢复；临时保护；清理障碍现场等。 计量单位：处 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH14001001 故障抢通 管道 1217.10 825.71 226.25 165.14 消耗量 5.71 2.86 WH14001002 架空 1622.80 1100.95 301.66 220.19 7.62 3.81 WH14001003 直埋 1794.07 1217.14 333.50 243.43 7.62 5.71"}, "keyword_score": 0.045062084085577575, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.045062084085577575, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.4866458310071812, "score": 0.4866458310071812, "semantic_score": 0.6758960082592971}]}
{"answer": "1. 室外布放单芯电力电缆流程包括检验、量裁、布放、绑扎固定等。[4]  \n2. 布放时需注意电缆的绑扎与固定，确保线路安全。[4]  \n3. 应进行端子制作并清理现场，保持作业环境整洁。[4]  \n4. 依据规程要求，结合地貌和电缆截面积确定具体操作。[4]  \n5. 参照表10.3.3.9中“室外布放单芯电力电缆”项目执行。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0102", "question": "在室外布放单芯电力电缆时，应如何确定布放流程？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 55.51297454869049, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "25dbfdd0ca53797cd2b6becf", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_490bd9cb7abbd472825f", "block_index": 258, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 258, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 90, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第259页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_90a470f61805b7b8a211", "page_number": 259, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_b8c4510bb2e45c4dc64a", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_b8c4510bb2e45c4dc64a", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第259页"], "section_title": "第259页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_490bd9cb7abbd472825f"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant