{"answer": "1. 应急发电超出2小时部分按实际工时折算工日，以2小时为基准。[2]  \n2. 机房土建零星维修包含防盗门更换项目。[1]  \n3. 防盗门更换属于WH33116007编码维护内容。[1]  \n4. 计量单位为“套²次”，综合单价156.86元。[1]  \n5. 超出部分计工日依据实际发生维护数量计算。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0105", "question": "在城区，应急发电的时长以2小时为起点，超出部分如何计工日，同时机房土建零星维修是否包含防盗门更换？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 69.99015941397239, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "ece98e71fe682adf424c53af", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_0f701cc1b1805ab733ef", "block_index": 315, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 315, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 96, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第316页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_bbd7746af004f9f0e555", "page_number": 316, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第316页"], "section_title": "第316页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_0f701cc1b1805ab733ef"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第316页 页码：316 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 310 表10.4.3.16 WH33116 机房土建零星维修 工作内容：1、机房内部墙面修复、外墙面修复； 2、顶面防水：使用防水卷材对机房顶面进行简易防水处理； 3、地面墙面防水：使用室内防水涂料对机房地板及墙面进行简易防水处理； 4、锁具更换：防盗门锁具更换； 5、防盗门更换：机房防盗门更换，回收； 6、防盗网更换：现场测量、制作、搬运、拆除、安装调整、清理现场等。 计量单位：综合 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH33116001 机房土建零星维 修 内部墙面修复 平方米²次 38.30 23.94 7.18 7.18 消耗量 0.21 — WH33116002 外墙面修复 平方米²次 60.19 37.62 11.29 11.29 0.33 — WH33116003 顶面防水 平方米²次 52.90 33.06 9.92 9.92 0.29 WH33116005 地面墙面防水 平方米²次 18.24 11.40 3.42 3.42 0.10 WH33116006 锁具更换 套²次 18.24 11.40 3.42 3.42 0.10 WH33116007 防盗门更换 套²次 156.86 98.04 29.41 29.41 0.86 WH33116008 防盗网更换 平方米 521.66 326.04 97.81 97.81 2.86"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.7499071329887438, "score": 0.7499071329887438, "semantic_score": 0.6427244756982055}, {"bm25_score": 53.95831972433817, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "895557a41828559b59f3680a", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_4e74229685c04c4d46a6", "block_index": 148, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 148, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 84, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第149页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_c6b6e41c97a8f00b28e2", "page_number": 149, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_dete