为Controller，光路 由的Mesh 角色为Agent。 光网关在遵循本规范基础上，需同步遵循最新版本《中国移动智能家庭网关技术规范》 和相关管理接口要求，实现RMS 平台纳管。 光网关应支持基于光路由的逻辑标识对光路由合法性进行认证的能力，应拒绝非法光 路由接入。 4.2. 设备形态 全光组网终端主要用于家庭用户和泛家庭用户，提供以太网/IP 类业务接入能力。全 光组网终端设备的硬件设计、天线连接等应稳定可靠。 表4-1 设备形态 产品类型 光网关 光路由 产品名称 Wi-Fi 7 光网关 Wi-Fi 6 光网关 Wi-Fi 7 光路由 Wi-Fi 6 光路由 网络侧接口 (WAN 口) 不低于XG-PON 推荐支持XG-PON Combo 2.5G 非对称 推荐支持2.5G 对称 用户 侧接 口 网络 接口 1 个光口 最大物理分光比不低于支持1:8 面板式：不少于1×GE 其他：不少于2×GE，至 少有1 个网口支持2.5GE 面板式：不少于1×GE 其他：不少于2×GE 不少于2×GE，至少有 1 个网口支持2.5GE 不少于2×GE WLAN 接口 2.4GHz 802.11be （2×2） + 5GHz 2.4GHz 802.11ax （2×2） + 5GHz 2.4GHz 802.11be （2×2） + 5GHz 2.4GHz 802.11ax （2×2） + 5GHz"}, "keyword_score": 0.6272125510584197, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.6272125510584197, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.7012388428512514, "score": 0.7012388428512514, "semantic_score": 0.7329643964767508}, {"bm25_score": 45.3309234996968, "chunk": {"document_id": "a2053ec18f1415e4912c510f", "id": "3a3f2c0bc27d1815ea693a4a", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_e3bc5306109b03034777", "block_index": 59, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 59, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": [], "content_hash": "ab72ce00c904f060e1a60edb2af37b98f35cb9464f510e1022e29c657a94cf99", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 6, "end_unit": 285, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0", "第60页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_c4b3e58e5ce3e156f087", "page_number": 60, "page_warning_codes": [], "parent_block_id": "blk_be75cf4df344a45df211", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_be75cf4df344a45df211", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0", "第60页"], "section_title": "第60页", "source": "中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_e3bc5306109b03034777"], "source_path": "/app/data/中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0", "version_id": "v_ab72ce00c904f060"}, "text": "章节：中国移动智慧家庭全光组网产品技术规范V2.0.0 > 第60页\n页码：60\n55\n附录 A 组网终端相关二维码标识要求\nA.1 光网关零配置二维码标识要求\n光网关终端应支持通过二维码实现放装零配置功能，在设备上展示张贴二维码标识，\n二维码应集成该设备的Wi-Fi 的SSID 和密码参数，具备扫码直接连接该台设备Wi-Fi 并\n进行POST 配置的功能，且光网关终端应支持依据是否已连接互联网决定是否进行PPPoE\n拨号。光网关零配置要求详见《中国移动智能家庭网关技术规范》，其中“model”字段\n推荐采用“FTTR-Wi-Fi6”或“FTTR-Wi-Fi7”。"}, "keyword_score": 0.5598057057960106, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.5598057057960106, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.6818980984215759, "score": 0.6818980984215759, "semantic_score": 0.7342234095468182}]}
{"answer": "1. 壁挂式交流配电箱安装人工费为161.88元/台。[1]  \n2. 其消耗量为1.42单位/台。[1]  \n3. 该费用包含开箱检验、定位安装、固定等工序。[1]  \n4. 项目编码为WH33109001，计量单位为台。[1]  \n5. 数据来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第310页。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0113", "question": "壁挂式交流配电箱的安装，其人工费和消耗量分别是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 40.6588823220263, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "36e3ca9051c2b34c98aa9fca", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f9a0f049e79c4e463062", "block_index": 309, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 309, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 69, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第310页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_ba29ad9a5ed8f788f5b1", "page_number": 310, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_974ec0403929fe284d50", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_974ec0403929fe284d50", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第310页"], "section_title": "第310页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_f9a0f049e79c4e463062"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "t