{"answer": "1. 最低缆线到屋脊的最小垂直净距为1.5米。[1]  \n2. 该数据出自《电信基础设施维护规程》表D.0.2。[1]  \n3. 适用于市内街道架设架空通信线路场景。[1]  \n4. 与房屋平顶的净距为5.5米，但屋脊要求更低。[1]  \n5. 建议严格按规程执行以确保安全。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0114", "question": "在市内街道架设架空通信线路时，最低缆线到屋脊的最小垂直净距是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 138.6790415354206, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "d8dfa78cb9362f0d69cd659c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b6f247a411f750a786e9", "block_index": 342, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 342, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 60, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9fb82b1766911b54a376", "page_number": 343, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "section_title": "第343页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_b6f247a411f750a786e9"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第343页 页码：343 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 337 2）D.0.2 架空通信线路与其他建筑物的最小垂直净距表： 表 D.0.2 架空通信线路与其他建筑物的最小垂直净距表 架设高度(m) 备注 架设高度(m) 备注 市内街道 4.5 5.5 市内里弄 （胡同） 4.0 5.0 铁路 3.0 7.5 公路 3.0 5.5 土路 3.0 5 0.6 最低缆线到屋脊 1.5 最低缆线到房屋平顶 河流 - 1 最低缆线到最高水位时的船桅顶 市区树木 - 1.5 郊区树木 - 1.5 其他通信 导线 - 0.6 一方最低缆线到另一方最高线条 最低缆线到树枝的垂直距离 与线路方向平时时 与线路方向交越时 名称 最低缆线到 地面 房屋建筑物 - 最低缆线到轨面"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.9204129445306704, "score": 0.9204129445306704, "semantic_score": 0.8863042064723862}, {"bm25_score": 74.0131809338872, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "23a3f4fcf6c1064229d8e25c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_aa79b3d4578c5a9d83a9", "block_index": 343, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 343, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 57, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第344页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_1ba9d238a2817aaf87e2", "page_number": 344, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_9fb82b1766911b54a376", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_9fb82b1766911b54a376", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第344页"], "section_title": "第344页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_aa79b3d4578c5a9d83a9"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_ty