{"answer": "1. 安装前需开箱检验并清洁搬运天线。[2]  \n2. 吊装加固天线后，调整方位角及俯仰角。[1]  \n3. 山区作业应特别注意防雷接地处理。[3]  \n4. 完成安装后需清理现场。[2]  \n5. 馈线布放需进行防水与连接固定。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0130", "question": "在山区安装移动通信天线时，应如何操作？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 31.293955275710058, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "3f00969dea6d8d04c016cb97", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_cf36aa6c43c41209ccee", "block_index": 261, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 261, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 133, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第262页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_8101c18e1af958158799", "page_number": 262, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_aae3ee7bd846d2d7167b", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_aae3ee7bd846d2d7167b", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第262页"], "section_title": "第262页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_cf36aa6c43c41209ccee"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id"