4.00 61.00 WH23115001 安装基带处理单元 壁挂式 558.14 348.84 104.65 104.65 消耗量 3.06 — WH23115002 机柜（箱）嵌入式 196.99 123.12 36.94 36.94 1.08 — WH23115003 安装电源转换器 （配电单元） 室内 145.92 91.20 27.36 27.36 0.80 WH23115004 室外 226.18 141.36 42.41 42.41 1.24 WH23115005 安装数据交换汇聚单元 228.00 142.50 42.75 42.75 1.25 WH23115006 安装PoE 供电模块 54.72 34.20 10.26 10.26 0.30"}, "keyword_score": 0.4575003005140762, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.4575003005140762, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.636374357877658, "score": 0.636374357877658, "semantic_score": 0.7130346681763359}, {"bm25_score": 13.593251620755115, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "65fc736cd1de828260bd32a9", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_4e5cb452cb5090a0fedd", "block_index": 51, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 51, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 58, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第52页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_f127cc796b81fd875b82", "page_number": 52, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_f441723fa231cad43995", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_f441723fa231cad43995", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第52页"], "section_title": "第52页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_4e5cb452cb5090a0fedd"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第52页 页码：52 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 46 信号源 设备 BBU+ RRU 和直 放站、AP 设备 季度 1. 检查清洁设备，无积尘，周边环境无杂物、水渍，照明良好。 2. 设备工作温湿度在正常范围内。 3. 设备安装固定牢固，柜门顺利打开。 4. 设备运行正常情况，无告警，供电安全可靠。 5. 各类缆线连接牢固，标签完整无缺失，设备接地正常。 设备 电源 季度 参照电源系统维护 室内 天馈 分布 系统 馈线 季度 1.馈线固定牢固，馈线卡无松动、锈蚀、脱落。弯曲处应圆滑、无硬弯，弯曲 半径符合安装规范要求。 2.馈线无变形、老化、扭曲现象，表皮无破损，周边无杂物及尖锐物体。 3.馈线进入机房必须有防水弯，馈线孔应密封良好，不留空隙。 4.馈线接头紧固无松动、无划伤、无露铜、无变形，密封良好、无积水。 5.馈线两端标识准确、清晰，且两端对应。 有源 器件 季度 1.有源器件运行情况，无告警，工作正常。 2.线缆外观完整无破损、连接牢固、标签正确完整。 3.有源器件接地，可靠连接，接地电阻符合要求。 无源 器件 季度 1.检查无源器件外观，无损坏。 2.无源器件固定情况，稳固，不受力、不悬空。 3.标签正确完整。 天线 季度 1.天线外壳无污垢、完整无破损，天线固定平稳牢固不破坏整体环境美观。无 障碍物阻挡。 2.检查系统的目标覆盖环境，无变化，如发生改变应及时上报。"}, "keyword_score": 0.31987268566141813, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.31987268566141813, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.6085078476801835, "score": 0.6085078476801835, "semantic_score": 0.7322086314025117}]}
{"answer": "1. 市区铁塔塔身垂直度测试综合人工费单价为43.32元。[1]  \n2. 市区接地网电阻测试综合人工费单价为5.70元。[2]  \n3. 两项测试均以“次”为计量单位，对应不同项目编码。[1][2]  \n4. 人工费包含技工与普工成本，按工日单价计算。[1][2]  \n5. 数据来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第249页和第248页。[1][2]", "case_id": "p6s-0133", "question": "市区铁塔塔身垂直度测试与接地网电阻测试的综合人工费单价分别是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 53.20271043388285, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "68a1c1448a91e95c36a18aa3", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b", "block_index": 248, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 248, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 84, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_f226dbe905d18319b912", "page_number": 249, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "section_title": "第249页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id"