{"answer": "1. 平原丘陵地区铁塔塔身垂直度测试综合单价为83.17元/座·次。[1]  \n2. 室外馈线走道安装综合单价为63.84元/米。[2]  \n3. 垂直度测试适用于平原、丘陵地形，项目编码WH22105002。[1]  \n4. 馈线走道安装计量单位为米，包含固定、接地等工序。[2]  \n5. 两项单价均来自《电信基础设施维护规程》相关表格。[1][2]", "case_id": "p6s-0134", "question": "平原丘陵地区铁塔塔身垂直度测试与室外馈线走道安装的综合单价分别是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 54.05825135908715, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "68a1c1448a91e95c36a18aa3", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b", "block_index": 248, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 248, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 84, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_f226dbe905d18319b912", "page_number": 249, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "section_title": "第249页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "versio