{"answer": "1. 销项税额按（1+2+3+4+5+6+7）×费率计算。[1]  \n2. 计算基数包含维护分项作业费至安全生产费之和。[1]  \n3. 费率依据具体项目规定，未在文档中明确统一值。[1]  \n4. 该计算方式适用于费用结算汇总表。[1]  \n5. 表—03为维护项目费用结算汇总表的对应表格。[4]", "case_id": "p6s-0141", "question": "在维护项目费用汇总表中，销项税额的计算依据是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 40.78332368723922, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "bd805e062a1bb6e9de169b79", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_1b8eb532fbe453a684ac", "block_index": 99, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 99, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 87, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第100页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_e45dff6bc96494994c99", "page_number": 100, "page_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_b9e63d348b763b429bb3", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_b9e63d348b763b429bb3", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第100页"], "section_title": "第100页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_1b8eb532fbe453a684ac"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基