{"answer": "1. 暗管、暗槽内穿放蝶形引入光缆机械成端的人工费为10.90元/十米条。[1]  \n2. 该作业对应的利润为2.18元/十米条。[1]  \n3. 人工费与利润均基于综合单价分解得出。[1]  \n4. 计量单位为十米条，对应项目编码WH41109002。[1]  \n5. 数据来源为《电信基础设施维护规程》第330页表10.5.1.9。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0143", "question": "当执行暗管、暗槽内穿放蝶形引入光缆并采用机械成端时，其综合单价中的人工费和利润分别是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 108.03124070931695, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "711b217183c929560d816440", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_ec106a7513cab7fddb6f", "block_index": 329, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 329, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 87, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第330页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_96293d3962c74ef8b4a3", "page_number": 330, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_3ae115276bc173ae0010", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_3ae115276bc173ae0010", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第330页"], "section_title": "第330页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_ec106a7513cab7fddb6f"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_