{"answer": "1. 机械成端综合单价中人工费为23.52元。[1]  \n2. 企业管理费为6.45元。[1]  \n3. 企业管理费按人工费的27.4%计算。[4]  \n4. 综合单价包含人工费、企业管理费和利润。[4]  \n5. 人工费单价技工为114元/工日。[4]", "case_id": "p6s-0144", "question": "自承式蝶形引入光缆布放和测试中，若使用机械成端，其综合单价中的人工费和企业管理费各为多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 110.82056070475717, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "2467800bf8ef29b6791440b4", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_a4d26781f8aeed313483", "block_index": 330, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 330, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 80, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第331页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_0ff52106a94e70408b9b", "page_number": 331, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_96293d3962c74ef8b4a3", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_96293d3962c74ef8b4a3", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第331页"], "section_title": "第331页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_a4d26781f8aeed313483"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "