{"answer": "1. 暴风雨后或存在外力影响隐患时，应立即巡回并加强巡检。[1]  \n2. 检查电杆是否倒塌、吊线垂度是否有明显变化。[2]  \n3. 查看警示牌是否歪斜，沿线有无外力施工行为。[2]  \n4. 检查挂钩、标志牌是否缺损，清除吊线上杂物。[3]  \n5. 及时上报发现的问题，并做好巡查记录。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0148", "question": "架空光缆在暴风雨后或存在外力影响隐患时，应如何进行巡检？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 44.986575628958235, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "362c9e604739de54353d1864", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_fcf0b5b7d27d0845c836", "block_index": 29, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 29, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 63, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第30页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_0076fb06d96d644e6685", "page_number": 30, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_6482a59bb198bfae8ecd", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_6482a59bb198bfae8ecd", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第30页"], "section_title": "第30页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_fcf0b5b7d27d0845c836"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第30页 页码：30 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 24 除草、培土 按需 预留符合规范，光缆弯曲半径符合规范 清理垃圾 修补人手井， 添补缺损的 大管、子管堵 塞 井内光缆 设 施 光缆、接头盒 固定绑扎 及时 整理、添补或 更换缺损的 光缆标志牌 过桥铁件 过桥钢管驳 接处、桥头支 架防锈 及时 管孔试通 管道路面发 生异常进行 管孔试通 及时 管孔使用前试用 架 空 光 缆 维 护 巡回 1～2 次/周 不得漏巡；徒步巡回每月不得少于1 次，暴风雨后或有外力 影响可能造成线路故障的隐患时应立即巡回和加强巡回。外 力施工现场按需随工监督，必要时日夜值守。每月按时提交 巡回原始记录。 整理、更换缺损的挂钩、标 示牌，清除架空线路上和镀 锌钢绞线上杂物 及时 无垃圾，光缆标志牌齐全清晰可见，光缆、接头盒挂靠安全， 光缆防护措施齐备，光缆的预留符合规范，光缆弯曲半径符 合规范 剪除影响线路的树枝 及时 如涉及到赔补，应进行三方协商再进行处理 检查接头盒和预留是否安全 可靠 及时 结合巡回进行"}, "keyword_score": 0.7850459836994282, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.7850459836994282, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.7193941123209829, "score": 0.7193941123209829, "semantic_score": 0.6912575960159351}, {"bm25_score": 22.260747190750312, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "f3a9fce5a3aa9ed44f630024", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_6b35c378c4ccd8ab0703", "block_index": 173, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 173, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 57, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第174页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_69f3d1dd84eaa7be2be1", "page_number": 174, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_0448465a89bfa194f94a", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_0448465a89bfa194f94a", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第174页"], "section