{"answer": "1. 楼外墙壁15m以下安装智慧灯杆（视频监控杆）基础费用为826.27元。[1]  \n2. 该费用对应标准为智慧灯杆（视频监控杆）15m以下的安装项目。[1]  \n3. 费用明细包含人工、材料及施工等综合成本。[1]  \n4. 不同高度区间费用不同，15m以下适用此标准。[1]  \n5. 若需更高精度数据，建议核对完整规程文件。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0155", "question": "在楼外墙壁15m以下安装智慧灯杆（视频监控杆）时，其基础费用是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 84.20947673851396, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "171c905ff1949657335ddc95", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_50d9bf32e66bbf5627e6", "block_index": 268, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 268, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 132, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第269页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_4057185128c1b0e13c8f", "page_number": 269, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_9e74c35d560b4dc4f4e2", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_9e74c35d560b4dc4f4e2", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第269页"], "section_title": "第269页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_50d9bf32e66bbf5627e6"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "