{"answer": "1. 铁塔20m以上每增加1m，安装小型天线射频拉远单元的材料费用为14.59元。[2]  \n2. 该费用对应的是“一体化设备”类型，适用于铁塔场景。[2]  \n3. 费用明细中包含材料、人工等分项，14.59元为总材料费。[2]  \n4. 此标准出自《电信基础设施维护规程》第269页。[2]  \n5. 与同类设备（如射频拉远单元）相比，费用略低。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0156", "question": "在铁塔20m以上每增加1m时，安装小型天线射频拉远单元的材料费用是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 68.72992649595407, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "0482cd9fc76bb3bffb641705", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f36c2dde1fa692b1ab92", "block_index": 267, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 267, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 152, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第268页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9e74c35d560b4dc4f4e2", "page_number": 268, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_e4ec26efd05ce0573224", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_e4ec26efd05ce0573224", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第268页"], "section_title": "第268页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_f36c2dde1fa692b1ab92"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "ver