{"answer": "1. 智慧灯杆（视频监控杆）15m以上每增加1m，安装扩装设备板件费用为91.20元。[1]  \n2. 该费用对应项目为“扩装设备板件（块）”，标准单价为91.20元。[1]  \n3. 不同高度区间的计价标准存在差异，需按实际高度分段计算。[2]  \n4. 15m以上每增1m的费用在多个文档中一致为91.20元。[1]  \n5. 费用明细包含人工、材料及管理成本，具体以规程为准。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0157", "question": "在智慧灯杆（视频监控杆）15m以上每增加1m时，安装扩装设备板件的费用是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 82.64627602674989, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "5853cdf43be2158dd66a2464", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_167932791ff478d5c288", "block_index": 270, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 270, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 62, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第271页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_01cdc113eac5363b6ca3", "page_number": 271, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_15c1d905c71825f1d550", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_15c1d905c71825f1d550", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第271页"], "section_title": "第271页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_167932791ff478d5c288"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": 