{"answer": "1. 发电时间超过2小时后，每增加1小时需计0.29工日。[1]  \n2. 山区应急发电超2小时部分按每小时0.29工日计算。[2]  \n3. 该标准适用于山区且发电时长超过2小时的情况。[3]  \n4. 工日计算依据为实际发电次数与超出时长。[3]  \n5. 人工工日单位为“工日”，计量方式为每小时增量。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0162", "question": "在山区进行应急发电，且发电时间超过2小时的情况下，每小时需要多少人工工日？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 38.060710423353434, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "5dde5ed6e53f62177672e78b", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_bb6d6dc18af5c409e7c4", "block_index": 288, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 288, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 71, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第289页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9d21c0981ae4c911f364", "page_number": 289, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_9c68d1625906abc73226", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_9c68d1625906abc73226", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第289页"], "section_title": "第289页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_bb6d6dc18af5c409e7c4"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63