{"answer": "1. 山区GPS天线系统巡检人工费为27.36元/次。[1]  \n2. 该费用对应项目编码WH21103003，计量单位为套·次。[1]  \n3. 人工费包含技工与普工成本，技工单价114元/工日。[1]  \n4. 巡检工作内容包括检查天线外观、固定情况及馈线状态。[1]  \n5. 该标准出自《电信基础设施维护规程》第229页表10.3.1.3。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0166", "question": "山区GPS天线系统巡检的人工费是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 35.26345725959741, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "52ea4a9342cfb3149c8ccb10", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_fac0c269f1f02ca58065", "block_index": 228, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 228, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 60, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第229页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_0930a00c2eafd0b050ce", "page_number": 229, "page_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_1d9ec7d694e84ce038a0", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_1d9ec7d694e84ce038a0", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第229页"], "section_title": "第229页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_fac0c269f1f02ca58065"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_pars