{"answer": "1. 平原、丘陵低压供电线路巡检消耗量为0.12百米·次。[1]  \n2. 该数据对应项目编码WH21105002，适用于架空/直埋/管道线路。[1]  \n3. 消耗量单位为百米·次，与巡检工作量相关。[1]  \n4. 巡检内容包括塔杆、电缆、标牌及杂物清理等。[1]  \n5. 此标准出自《电信基础设施维护规程》第231页。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0167", "question": "平原、丘陵低压供电线路巡检的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 40.94648124402096, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "e7cfd5483ff7c333edae85bb", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_ea6a3b7cef1122038068", "block_index": 230, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 230, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 58, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第231页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_82060a7798f84e2357f4", "page_number": 231, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_9ace352b3da56f5708b6", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_9ace352b3da56f5708b6", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第231页"], "section_title": "第231页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_ea6a3b7cef1122038068"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c