{"answer": "1. 按规范挖坑并埋设地锚，确保基础稳固。[1]  \n2. 使用水泥杆夹板法安装7/2.6单股拉线。[1]  \n3. 紧拉拉线至规定张力后固定。[1]  \n4. 回填土壤并分层夯实。[1]  \n5. 安装中把、上把及警示保护装置。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0168", "question": "在综合土质地条件下，安装水泥杆夹板法装7/2.6单股拉线时，应执行哪些操作步骤？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 80.1559778174617, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "a337b883b539fcace3247291", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_e1621096faeaf5a1e5dd", "block_index": 184, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 184, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 161, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第185页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_f15a576cb391552ece75", "page_number": 185, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_d92ab280209d6f23d40c", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_d92ab280209d6f23d40c", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第185页"], "section_title": "第185页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_e1621096faeaf5a1e5dd"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 >