{"answer": "1. 城区架空光缆线路车辆巡回的人工费单价为3.91元/工日。[1]  \n2. 该费用对应项目编码WH11002003，适用于城区路段。[1]  \n3. 综合单价为5.76元，其中人工费占3.91元。[1]  \n4. 计量单位为千米²次，按实际维护次数计算。[3]  \n5. 吊线垂度变化属巡查内容，需上报但不单独计费。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0172", "question": "对于城区架空光缆线路车辆巡回，若发现吊线垂度变化，应依据何种人工费单价进行计费？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 76.46109433117344, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "f3a9fce5a3aa9ed44f630024", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_6b35c378c4ccd8ab0703", "block_index": 173, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 173, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 57, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第174页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_69f3d1dd84eaa7be2be1", "page_number": 174, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_0448465a89bfa194f94a", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_0448465a89bfa194f94a", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第174页"], "section_title": "第174页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_6b35c378c4ccd8ab0703"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v