{"answer": "1. 驻波比测试前需进行仪表校对。[3]  \n2. 按规程要求执行驻波比测试操作。[3]  \n3. 测试后应记录并反馈结果。[3]  \n4. 测试周期为每季度一次。[4]  \n5. 适用于平原、丘陵等不同地貌区域。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0183", "question": "在平原丘陵地区，对天馈线系统进行驻波比测试应遵循哪些步骤？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 45.00787241701036, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "e8513e8aa3405fff338783f1", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_c8e98eca8d51dee95f7f", "block_index": 244, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 244, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 65, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第245页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_750f473662a9e5144fe3", "page_number": 245, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_43dead3b6db2a2044886", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_43dead3b6db2a2044886", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第245页"], "section_title": "第245页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_c8e98eca8d51dee95f7f"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第245页 页码：245 T/CAI