{"answer": "1. GB 50689标准涉及通信局（站）防雷与接地工程设计。[2]  \n2. 该标准属于通信基础设施工程设计范畴。[2]  \n3. 主要适用于通信局站的防雷与接地系统设计。[2]  \n4. 是电信基础设施工程设计的重要规范之一。[2]  \n5. 与通信线路、设备安装等工程设计相关联。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0185", "question": "GB 50689标准涉及哪类工程设计？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 32.18361604282482, "chunk": {"document_id": "5256824b6b72b3f03d9c7a2c", "id": "2eda6960dfbb194d0f84e4b0", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_a9c530c0f04ac083aa2b", "block_index": 4, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 4, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": [], "content_hash": "dcf78195a87f01f45fc99b3af1c541f948a7cc8b6578168c0cb862cf9b620277", "detected_codes": ["T22239"], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 4, "end_unit": 70, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "第5页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_07d878a29f41becf5176", "page_number": 5, "page_warning_codes": [], "parent_block_id": "blk_a360264dc7a73d4748b4", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_a360264dc7a73d4748b4", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "第5页"], "section_title": "第5页", "source": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_a9c530c0f04ac083aa2b"], "source_path": "/app/data/智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "version_id": "v_dcf78195a87f01f4"}, "text": "章节：智慧家庭装