{"answer": "1. 嵌墙式有源综合柜综合单价为777.77元/架。[1]  \n2. 该价格对应项目编码WH33104002，计量单位为架。[1]  \n3. 价格包含人工、企业管理费及利润等成本。[1]  \n4. 与落地式有源综合柜（357.20元）相比，嵌墙式单价更高。[1]  \n5. 信息来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第305页表10.4.3.4。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0197", "question": "嵌墙式有源综合柜的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 35.19114788292933, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "b2edc2384d6b845e0005973a", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b659506d5ac72d76f867", "block_index": 304, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 304, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 74, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第305页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_15bf63cad9f641df2a83", "page_number": 305, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_54e381a0e70ccb0838c0", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_54e381a0e70ccb0838c0", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第305页"], "section_title": "第305页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_b659506d5ac72d76f867"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d8690