{"answer": "1. 更换拉线需先装、拆临时拉线，再拆旧拉线并装新拉线。[1]  \n2. 操作中不更换地锚，按水泥杆夹板法安装7/2.2单股拉线。[1]  \n3. 作业应在平原地区按规程执行，确保拉线牢固可靠。[1]  \n4. 安装前应检查地锚状态，确认无松动或位移。[3]  \n5. 拉线收紧后需回填土并夯实，保证稳固性。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0200", "question": "在平原地区，更换水泥杆夹板法装7/2.2单股拉线时，应如何操作？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 75.07264879910993, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "f25f603904b58475c9463e67", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_7a2f2237b064fe59c3ed", "block_index": 193, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 193, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 151, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第194页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_06212655323bf588776a", "page_number": 194, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_177bc8c74e15b97bfbd8", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_177bc8c74e15b97bfbd8", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第194页"], "section_title": "第194页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_7a2f2237b064fe59c3ed"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d8690