{"answer": "1. 机房外墙修复每平方米综合单价为60.19元。[2]  \n2. 外墙面修复人工费为37.62元/平方米。[2]  \n3. 机房室外环境清理人工费为15.96元/站²次（土建机房）。[1]  \n4. 人工费包含技工与普工，技工单价114元/工日，普工61元/工日。[1][2]  \n5. 若同时作业，需分别计取对应项目费用，不可合并。[1][2]", "case_id": "p6s-0203", "question": "机房外墙修复每平方米的综合单价是多少，若同时涉及机房室外环境清理的作业内容，其人工费构成如何？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 45.920848532145236, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "c663286c5bf2258dc95cdc2c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_116e887ae40400d3ee8a", "block_index": 314, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 314, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 50, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第315页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "page_number": 315, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_496d790acbc99607a9c2", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_496d790acbc99607a9c2", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第315页"], "section_title": "第315页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_116e887ae40400d3ee8a"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程