{"answer": "1. 100kVA以下干式变压器安装调试人工费为282.72元/台·次。[1]  \n2. 干式变压器安装调试的计量单位为台·次。[1]  \n3. 机房防盗门更换的单位是“次”。[2]  \n4. 防盗门更换工作内容包含拆除、安装及清理现场。[4]  \n5. 该项工作按实际发生数量计算费用。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0204", "question": "对100kVA以下干式变压器进行安装调试时，其综合单价中人工费部分是多少，若同时需完成机房防盗门更换，则该项工作的单位是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 57.027687767591196, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "a868ffbc2cc9ef4973b54d6e", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_ed2b3188d0a205b810a4", "block_index": 316, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 316, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 64, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第317页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_a87f75b9105c754e92a6", "page_number": 317, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_bbd7746af004f9f0e555", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_bbd7746af004f9f0e555", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第317页"], "section_title": "第317页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_ed2b3188d0a205b810a4"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route"