{"answer": "1. 机房顶面防水综合单价为52.90元/平方米²次。[1]  \n2. 地面墙面防水综合单价为18.24元/平方米²次。[1]  \n3. 机房室外环境清理人工费未在表中单独列出，需按实际发生数量计算。[3]  \n4. 同时执行室外清理时，人工费构成无明确差异说明。[3]  \n5. 两项工作的人工费均包含技工与普工费用，但具体构成未区分叠加情况。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0205", "question": "机房顶面防水与地面墙面防水的综合单价分别是多少，若同时需执行机房室外环境清理，其对应的人工费构成差异是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 60.592357574012496, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "ece98e71fe682adf424c53af", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_0f701cc1b1805ab733ef", "block_index": 315, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 315, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 96, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第316页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_bbd7746af004f9f0e555", "page_number": 316, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第316页"], "section_title": "第316页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_0f701cc1b1805ab733ef"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", 