{"answer": "1. 角钢塔、三管塔、四管塔35m以下市区天馈线系统巡检综合单价为94.85元/站·次。[1]  \n2. 该单价适用于天馈线系统巡检工作内容，包括外观检查与接地等。[1]  \n3. 巡检计量单位为“站·次”，对应项目编码WH21102001。[1]  \n4. 人工费占比约62.5%，其中技工与普工费用已细分。[1]  \n5. 本数据来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第227页表10.3.1.2。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0206", "question": "角钢塔、三管塔、四管塔35m以下的天馈线系统巡检，市区的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 74.60461939013456, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "ce70fb71bf86c85077ccfe2a", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f9067aa48604c0d8c2f5", "block_index": 226, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 226, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 140, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第227页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_43ae3c37ce2383dccf4f", "page_number": 227, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_890e4a269393c2b21ace", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_890e4a269393c2b21ace", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第227页"], "section_title": "第227页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_f9067aa48604c0d8c2f5"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "tit