{"answer": "1. 山区基站主设备巡检技工人工费为17.10元/工日。[1]  \n2. 项目编码为WH21101003，计量单位为三台·次。[1]  \n3. 综合单价为27.36元，其中人工费含技工部分。[1]  \n4. 巡检工作包括清洁滤网、告警处理、拨打测试等。[1]  \n5. 按每三台设备为基本计量单位计算。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0207", "question": "山区基站主设备巡检的技工人工费是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 36.606906024619754, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "31ca53eabc210bec4a94da9e", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_722406ccf06a4f216862", "block_index": 225, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 225, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 62, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第226页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_890e4a269393c2b21ace", "page_number": 226, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_7be0657a654ec27bac03", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_7be0657a654ec27bac03", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第226页"], "section_title": "第226页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_722406ccf06a4f216862"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default",