{"answer": "1. 更换电杆地线单位消耗量为每条（条）[3]。  \n2. 更换吊线保护装置单位消耗量为每米（米）[2]。  \n3. 地线类型包括直埋式、延伸式、拉线式，按条计量[3]。  \n4. 吊线保护装置更换按米计算，含拆除与安装[2]。  \n5. 消耗量依据具体地线类型及项目编码确定[3]。", "case_id": "p6s-0218", "question": "更换电杆地线与更换吊线保护装置的单位消耗量分别是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 53.020572896324836, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "74207e88e3fcb93a6e60028b", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_64d79e1cf185aff79478", "block_index": 127, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 127, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 104, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第128页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_1601eacdb0854f3bb8de", "page_number": 128, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_2bc86a72dc850c513de7", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_2bc86a72dc850c513de7", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第128页"], "section_title": "第128页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_64d79e1cf185aff79478"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节