{"answer": "1. 防雹保护设施检查属于太阳能光伏离网发电系统检修内容。[1]  \n2. 检修工作包含防雹保护设施、支架及基础等项目。[3]  \n3. 该检查是专项检修中的常规作业项。[2]  \n4. 属于发电设备专项检修范畴。[1]  \n5. 与光伏板阵列清洁同属维护项目。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0226", "question": "太阳能光伏离网发电系统检修中，防雹保护设施的检查属于哪项内容？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 80.22609575515703, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "8be5803c7b6b81a6c36af5bd", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_065aee4417bf2bc9bb9a", "block_index": 317, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 317, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 59, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第318页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_db4ef65a5a2b90112e8d", "page_number": 318, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_a87f75b9105c754e92a6", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_a87f75b9105c754e92a6", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第318页"], "section_title": "第318页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_065aee4417bf2bc9bb9a"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": 