{"answer": "1. 敷设6孔（3X2）塑料管道时，利润为164.95元/百米。[1]  \n2. 技工人工费为824.75元/百米。[1]  \n3. 技工人工费与利润之和为989.70元/百米。[1]  \n4. 该价格基于综合单价表中WH12022005项数据。[1]  \n5. 计量单位为百米，需按实际长度折算。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0228", "question": "敷设6孔塑料管道时，技工人工费与利润之和为多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 28.75874696628598, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "9970d3dcdf2c44cdaefecd51", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_0b413e88f29c78d9bfed", "block_index": 210, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 210, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 95, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第211页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_2943629f3bf7d8a86e00", "page_number": 211, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_fd5c82793ab9362202da", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_fd5c82793ab9362202da", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第211页"], "section_title": "第211页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_0b413e88f29c78d9bfed"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text"