{"answer": "1. 一体化壁挂式安装的消耗量为4.10。[1]  \n2. 该消耗量对应项目编码WH33108003。[1]  \n3. 消耗量单位为“台”，按实际发生数量计算。[3]  \n4. 与一体化落地式（消耗量2.80）不同，壁挂式更高。[2]  \n5. 该数据出自《电信基础设施维护规程》第309页表10.4.3.8。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0235", "question": "一体化壁挂式安装的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 28.56335745392559, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "3f1121bb0a2c78abefa8b7bd", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_da170ef80cb7d1f80b86", "block_index": 308, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 308, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 65, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第309页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_974ec0403929fe284d50", "page_number": 309, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_4914a98a16956a17a6fb", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_4914a98a16956a17a6fb", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第309页"], "section_title": "第309页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_da170ef80cb7d1f80b86"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", 