{"answer": "1. WH21115004漏泄式同轴电缆巡检的计量单位是百米·次。[1]  \n2. 该单位用于统计巡检作业量，按每百米计算一次。[1]  \n3. 巡检工作内容包括外观、固定情况检查等。[1]  \n4. 与馈线系统调测单位“百米条”类似但不相同。[3]  \n5. 项目编码为WH21115004，对应维护分项作业。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0252", "question": "WH21115004 漏泄式同轴电缆巡检的计量单位是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 57.94881012402107, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "d3e3f69ff07c4d7974ea7013", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_1ef5fabee14ec64b1347", "block_index": 240, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 240, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 100, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第241页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_2c3d5f6ccd3d0847bf14", "page_number": 241, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_7c2d2add39b28db32f5b", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_7c2d2add39b28db32f5b", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第241页"], "section_title": "第241页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_1ef5fabee14ec64b1347"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第241页 页码：241 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 235 表10.3.1.15 WH21115 室内分布和WLAN 系统巡检 工作内容：检查室分天线外观、固定情况，清理遮挡物；检查外露馈线外观以及固定情况外观，检查清洁无源设备外观、线缆连接和标签等。 计量单位：综合 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH21115001 室内分布和 WLAN 系统巡检 无源 50 面·次 次 62.02 38.76 11.63 11.63 消耗量 0.34 WH21115002 有源 20 面·次 次 29.18 18.24 5.47 5.47 0.16 WH21115003 直放站设备 台·次 次 21.89 13.68 4.10 4.10 0.12 WH21115004 漏泄式同轴电缆 百米·次 次 36.48 22.80 6.84 6.84 0.20 WH21115005 无线局域网接入点 （AP）设备 20 套·次 次 29.18 18.24 5.47 5.47 0.16 注：1.室内分布系统巡检按照同一信号源下天线数量计算。无源系统巡检按照同一信号源下每50 面天线计算，不足50 面按50 面计算。有源系统巡检按照每20 面天线计算，不足20 面 天线按照20 面计算。 2.安装在普通隧道的直放站和泄露式同轴电缆巡检按相应子目乘以系数1.1，高铁、地铁隧道、直放站和漏泄式同轴电缆巡检按相应子目乘以系数1.5。 3.直放站+八木天线组合巡检按照WH21115003 子目乘以系数1.2。 4.WLAN 系统巡检按照每20 面天线计算，不足20 面天线按照20 面计算。"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.8086286192315002, "score": 0.8086286192315002, "semantic_score": 0.7266123131878576}, {"bm25_score": 31.169478582220787, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "db8a91a8aa6eed3abf6b5879", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_a14a1ada2dacd6a22aa2", "block_index": 263, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 263, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 81, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第264页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_ad11ac1badca94c8561