{"answer": "1. 更换井盖的综合单价为54.17元/个。[2]  \n2. 人井清淤作业中技工人工费为99.73元/个。[1]  \n3. 技工人工费占人井清淤综合单价的比例约为67.8%。[1]  \n4. 人井清淤综合单价为147.00元/个。[1]  \n5. 技工人工费按0.42工日计算，单价114.00元/工日。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0258", "question": "更换井盖的综合单价是多少？人井清淤作业中，技工人工费占比多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 34.7399958838609, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "ad8e07f5c6236a0b7c42bd25", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_09344cd098ac73da9b27", "block_index": 220, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 220, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 71, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第221页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_94c00df03b2174d4e9ed", "page_number": 221, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_891c9ec94d0c8af641f6", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_891c9ec94d0c8af641f6", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第221页"], "section_title": "第221页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_09344cd098ac73da9b27"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": 