 消耗量 2.00 2.00 注：管廊内敷设的光缆视同管道光缆，按管道光缆条目取费。 表10.2.1.10 WH11010 通信管道日常检修 工作内容：及时更换井盖、井框，井号油漆，描字，清理井内淤泥、杂物；整治人孔内的托架、托板和标志；清洗管孔、人孔内抽水；人手孔井面杂物清理等。 计量单位：千米²次 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH11010001 通信管道日常检修 515.90 350.00 95.90 70.00 消耗量 2.00 2.00 注：管廊视同通信管道，按通信管道条目取费。"}, "keyword_score": 0.5277101285149547, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.5277101285149547, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.5787237789300081, "score": 0.5787237789300081, "semantic_score": 0.6005867719650311}]}
{"answer": "1. 人井清淤人工消耗量为技工0.42工日、普工0.85工日。[2]  \n2. 临时抽水积水场景人工消耗量为0.25工日。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0259", "question": "人井清淤的消耗量中，人工消耗量是多少？临时抽水作业中，积水场景的消耗量是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 31.94866804633772, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "9278fc1fa10e15baa1de8ec1", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_3bc339b904b5be221ce9", "block_index": 219, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 219, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 49, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第220页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_891c9ec94d0c8af641f6", "page_number": 220, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_8b1abc03bbb47e41a7af", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_8b1abc03bbb47e41a7af", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第220页"], "section_title": "第220页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_3bc339b904b5be221ce9"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第220页 页码：220 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 214 表10.2.2.31 WH12031 临时抽