{"answer": "1. 更换10米以下木电杆在综合土条件下，技工人工费为63.83元。[1]  \n2. 该费用包含在综合单价470.42元中，对应项目编码WH12013013。[1]  \n3. 技工消耗量为1.50工日，单价114.00元/工日。[1]  \n4. 人工费按技工1.50工日×114.00元计算得出。[1]  \n5. 该标准依据《电信基础设施维护规程》第202页表10.2.2.13。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0260", "question": "更换10米以下木电杆在综合土条件下，技工人工费是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 39.46719437880643, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "a08fd0f65890c68b54ac7790", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_d5143ecba247fc0336c2", "block_index": 201, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 201, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 146, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第202页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_7a7497b1e69eab530253", "page_number": 202, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_7e6944f4690f0bebf57e", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_7e6944f4690f0bebf57e", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第202页"], "section_title": "第202页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_d5143ecba247fc0336c2"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程"