{"answer": "1. 检查管道或人孔是否有沉陷、破损、井盖丢失等情况。[1]  \n2. 进行路由探测，确认线路走向是否正常。[1]  \n3. 检查沿线重点部位保护是否到位，有无外力施工影响安全。[1]  \n4. 查看沿线是否发生鼠害、蚁害等威胁线路的情况。[1]  \n5. 做好巡查记录，并将发现问题及时上报。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0284", "question": "在信息通信光缆线路维护中，管道光缆线路徒步巡回的检查项目包括哪些？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 53.37943637374166, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "901684f8902440d567a21566", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_979662a351fdafe10dcc", "block_index": 176, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 176, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 40, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第177页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_8b7a982d816ef5ee07c5", "page_number": 177, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_903b982cfd3ac498a79a", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_903b982cfd3ac498a79a", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第177页"], "section_title": "第177页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_979662a351fdafe10dcc"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"},