{"answer": "1. 挂墙式有源综合机箱尺寸为218.88×136.80×41.04mm。[1]  \n2. 该型号综合柜综合单价为218.88元/台。[1]  \n3. 价格信息来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第252页。[1]  \n4. 该设备为室内挂墙式有源类型，适用于特定安装场景。[1]  \n5. 详细参数与价格以实际工程定额为准。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0287", "question": "挂墙上那种有源柜子，尺寸和价格大概是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 12.233981551873388, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "3f406ad653cd6ded7e011a40", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_cd3f0181f687fe818025", "block_index": 251, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 251, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 50, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第252页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_cfb81fbcd005a2b704a6", "page_number": 252, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_c541def97977360a1ca9", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_c541def97977360a1ca9", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第252页"], "section_title": "第252页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_cd3f0181f687fe818025"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"