rieval_score": 0.637003757628245, "score": 0.637003757628245, "semantic_score": 0.5935790892588644}]}
{"answer": "1. 山区天线信号测试综合单价为27.36元/扇区·次。[1]  \n2. 山区蓄电池容量测试综合单价为508.90元/组·次。[2]  \n3. 天线信号测试包含互调与发射功率测试。[1]  \n4. 蓄电池测试包括容量与内阻测试。[2]  \n5. 项目按地貌分山区、平原、丘陵等执行不同单价。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0294", "question": "在山区进行天线信号测试和蓄电池容量测试时，分别对应的综合单价是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 34.649282110738866, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "6ef6abcdb9faa71cd577015c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_ca2123f114d93a220d93", "block_index": 245, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 245, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 83, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第246页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_3f54af53cc55c652d612", "page_number": 246, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_750f473662a9e5144fe3", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_750f473662a9e5144fe3", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第246页"], "section_title": "第246页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_ca2123f114d93a220d93"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"},