{"answer": "1. 平原丘陵地区蓄电池内阻测试综合单价为29.18元/次。[1]  \n2. 平原丘陵地区天线互调测试综合单价为21.89元/次。[2]  \n3. 两项测试均按“次”为计量单位，适用于平原丘陵地貌。[4]  \n4. 蓄电池内阻测试属WH22103005项目，对应平原丘陵区域。[1]  \n5. 天线互调测试属WH22102002项目，对应平原丘陵区域。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0296", "question": "平原丘陵地区蓄电池内阻测试与天线互调测试的综合单价各是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 39.35667138671966, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "8279275e4fc4b06b3016b82a", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_8e405674987068a35fda", "block_index": 246, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 246, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 83, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第247页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9d751c87303cee9d7df8", "page_number": 247, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_3f54af53cc55c652d612", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_3f54af53cc55c652d612", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第247页"], "section_title": "第247页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_8e405674987068a35fda"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_i