{"answer": "1. 35米以上铁塔专项维修包括塔体结构检查与螺丝紧固。[1]  \n2. 需进行漆面除锈及刷漆作业。[1]  \n3. 应开展塔基强度测试。[1]  \n4. 维修项目编码为WH23129002，综合单价395.81元/座²次。[1]  \n5. 作业需按规程执行，计量单位为座²次。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0297", "question": "对于35米以上的角钢塔、三管塔、四管塔，铁塔专项维修应如何操作？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 64.7310223979805, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "611a9eb6554a2b482561c775", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b6285831e06aa97fe297", "block_index": 285, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 285, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 87, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第286页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_244e584d80ec7c6187b4", "page_number": 286, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_29cf0bf514119eeccb11", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_29cf0bf514119eeccb11", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第286页"], "section_title": "第286页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_b6285831e06aa97fe297"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "