{"answer": "1. 清理范围包括机房、铁塔、院墙及护网内外周边一米内杂草杂物。[1]  \n2. 作业对象涵盖一体化机房（方舱）及一体化机柜类型。[2]  \n3. 应按规程要求清除外部环境中的杂草与障碍物。[4]  \n4. 作业需覆盖机房主体结构周边区域，确保环境整洁安全。[3]  \n5. 维护频率依据实际发生次数和地貌类型确定。[4]", "case_id": "p6s-0298", "question": "在机房室外环境清理中，针对一体化机房的作业应遵循哪些步骤？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 57.290250239692966, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "c663286c5bf2258dc95cdc2c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_116e887ae40400d3ee8a", "block_index": 314, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 314, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 50, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第315页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "page_number": 315, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_496d790acbc99607a9c2", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_496d790acbc99607a9c2", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第315页"], "section_title": "第315页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_116e887ae40400d3ee8a"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869