": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 49, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第141页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_0ef0a052f1750fd067aa", "page_number": 141, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_a7f64f01a676b668d51e", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_a7f64f01a676b668d51e", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第141页"], "section_title": "第141页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_81fb92117d9a1ebf98e4"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第141页 页码：141 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 135 WH23123 铁塔专项 维修 1.地貌（平原、山区、 城区） 2.铁塔类型 座²次 根据规程要求的操作方 式和实际发生次数计算 1.塔体结构检查。 2.螺丝紧固、 3.漆面除锈刷漆。 4.塔基强度测试。 WH23124 机房室外 环境清理 1.地貌（平原、山区、 城区） 2.机房类型、铁塔类 型 站²次 根据规程要求的操作方 式和实际发生次数计算 机房、铁塔、院墙、护网外内部以 及周边一米杂草集中清除。 WH23125 机房土建 零星维修 1.地貌（平原、山区、 城区） 2.维修工作项目 平方 米²次 樘²次 根据规程要求的操作方 式和实际发生次数计算 1.机房内外部墙面修复。 2.机房顶面简易防水处理。 3.机房地板及墙面简易防水处理。 4.防盗门锁具更换。 5.机房防盗门更换，回收。 6.防盗网更换"}, "keyword_score": 0.383741748668312, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.383741748668312, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.5347252984216042, "score": 0.5347252984216042, "semantic_score": 0.599432534030158}]}
{"answer": "1. 墙面防水作业内容为使用室内防水涂料对墙面进行简易处理。[1]  \n2. 顶面防水使用防水卷材进行简易防水处理。[1]  \n3. 地面墙面防水的计量单位为平方米²次。[1]  \n4. 墙面防水属于机房土建零星维修项目之一。[3]  \n5. 作业内容包含墙面及地面的防水处理。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0299", "question": "机房土建零星维修中，墙面防水的作业内容和计量单位是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 66.3867767442421, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "ece98e71fe682adf424c53af", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_0f701cc1b1805ab733ef", "block_index": 315, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 315, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 96, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第316页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_bbd7746af004f9f0e555", "page_number": 316, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_ac778d09371d61dd6709", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第316页"], "section_title": "第316页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_0f701cc1b1805ab733ef"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "titl