{"answer": "1. 山区安装水泥撑杆时，综合单价按平原地区标准的1.5倍计取。[1]  \n2. 该规定适用于装水泥撑杆项目，对应子目为WH12010004至WH12010006。[1]  \n3. 丘陵、城区则按1.2倍计取，山区标准更高。[1]  \n4. 此系数已明确标注于规程第198页表10.2.2.10中。[1]  \n5. 该规则同样适用于更换撑杆等类似作业。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0305", "question": "在山区安装水泥撑杆时，综合单价应按平原地区标准的多少倍计取？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 52.6888141813271, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "bbf057376a33c30ed00b70b7", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_2656753db849e7872bb1", "block_index": 197, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 197, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 85, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第198页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_87ffa4609c7cd39a8763", "page_number": 198, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_52ce5ad84e9221d195dd", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_52ce5ad84e9221d195dd", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第198页"], "section_title": "第198页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_2656753db849e7872bb1"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第198页 页码：198 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 192 表10.2.2.10 WH12010 安装撑杆 工作内容：现场搬运，挖杆坑，装撑杆，装卡盘或横木，回填夯实，杆梢和杆根的固定等。 计量单位：根 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH12010001 安装撑杆 装木撑杆 综合土 190.11 128.98 35.34 25.80 消耗量 0.74 0.74 WH12010002 软石 225.76 153.16 41.97 30.63 0.65 1.30 WH12010003 坚石 312.12 211.75 58.02 42.35 1.21 1.21 WH12010004 装水泥撑杆 综合土 209.97 142.45 39.03 28.49 0.81 0.81 WH12010005 软石 298.47 202.49 55.48 40.50 0.86 1.72 WH12010006 坚石 408.59 277.20 75.95 55.44 1.58 1.58 注：本条目适用于平原地区；用于丘陵、城区时综合单价按相应子目的1.2 倍计取，用于山区时综合单价按相应子目的1.5 倍计取。"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.804750734850809, "score": 0.804750734850809, "semantic_score": 0.7210724783582986}, {"bm25_score": 42.579681783419915, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "f6d858bcc3983da8b3575959", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_e900cc3a0ac75de7b591", "block_index": 198, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 198, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 141, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第199页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_2e803ecf33d5044c50c3", "page_number": 199, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_87ffa4609c7cd39a8763", "parser_name":