{"answer": "1. 在平原地区更换木杆另缠法装7/2.6单股拉线，技工人工费单价为268.78元。[1]  \n2. 该价格适用于平原地区，不包含城区或山区调整系数。[1]  \n3. 拆除拉线人工工日按安装的0.6倍计取。[1]  \n4. 项目编号为WH12009040，对应平原地区单价。[1]  \n5. 未提供其他费用明细，仅限技工人工费。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0306", "question": "在平原地区更换木杆另缠法装7/2.6单股拉线时，技工人工费单价为多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 78.5360744590861, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "0a42bddf1894bc4d44e60a1c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_c83c7e1b6fbf76dca52c", "block_index": 195, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 195, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 196, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第196页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_3cb5330b438594c96d9d", "page_number": 196, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_6d5673196034a9b73cd8", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_6d5673196034a9b73cd8", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第196页"], "section_title": "第196页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_c83c7e1b6fbf76dca52c"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v