{"answer": "1. 装维服务计划需掌握光纤到户、物联网等新兴业务运维技能。[1]  \n2. 应熟悉交互式网络电视及智能家居组网配置能力。[2]  \n3. 需具备智能组网与复杂故障处理的实操能力。[1]  \n4. 服务中应融入销售技巧与交付能力以匹配市场需求。[2]  \n5. 需依据安全规范和用户信息安全要求开展作业。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0312", "question": "装维服务计划如何与市场趋势对齐？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 16.98334979422773, "chunk": {"document_id": "5256824b6b72b3f03d9c7a2c", "id": "1c317b1dd2cebfbf9647d03e", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_e4bef2211b5bd8cddc76", "block_index": 11, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 11, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "dcf78195a87f01f45fc99b3af1c541f948a7cc8b6578168c0cb862cf9b620277", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 4, "end_unit": 96, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "第12页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_7678536353d72d515bc9", "page_number": 12, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_941760edda054c582a94", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_941760edda054c582a94", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", "第12页"], "section_title": "第12页", "source": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_e4bef2211b5bd8cddc76"], "source_path": "/app/data/智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "智慧家庭装维工程与管理职业技能等级标准", 