{"answer": "1. 拉线埋设不牢需按规程重新安装或更换拉线。[2]  \n2. 应挖坑并埋设地锚，确保拉线稳固。[2]  \n3. 回填后需夯实，并做中、上把处理。[2]  \n4. 若地锚松动，可考虑制作新横木地锚加固。[3]  \n5. 作业应依据标准流程执行，避免安全隐患。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0316", "question": "拉线在土里埋得不牢，怎么修？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 3.3676839611988285, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "f25f603904b58475c9463e67", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_7a2f2237b064fe59c3ed", "block_index": 193, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 193, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 151, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第194页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_06212655323bf588776a", "page_number": 194, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_177bc8c74e15b97bfbd8", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_177bc8c74e15b97bfbd8", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第194页"], "section_title": "第194页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_7a2f2237b064fe59c3ed"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第194页 页码：