{"answer": "1. 吊线松动需按规程进行紧固，包括拆除原终端、延长吊线等操作。[4]  \n2. 紧固吊线工作应根据地貌类型（平原、丘陵等）执行相应作业流程。[4]  \n3. 作业内容包含装拆临时辅助吊线及拧紧紧固件等步骤。[4]  \n4. 若现场无法处理，应上报系统并安排专业人员修复。[3]  \n5. 维护企业须在规定时限内完成故障处理，确保通信畅通。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0317", "question": "吊线松了，怎么处理？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 5.733517713851421, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "eeb52d4d64c5179d52e35b71", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_63c1424e4ccd361fb6f5", "block_index": 183, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 183, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 66, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第184页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_d92ab280209d6f23d40c", "page_number": 184, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_e0e1c0341b3adc673e85", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_e0e1c0341b3adc673e85", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第184页"], "section_title": "第184页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_63c1424e4ccd361fb6f5"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"},