{"answer": "1. 临时抽水流水的综合单价为128.98元/个。[1]  \n2. 该单价包含人工费、企业管理费及利润。[1]  \n3. 人工消耗量为技工0.5工日，普工0.5工日。[1]  \n4. 项目编码为WH12031002。[1]  \n5. 适用于人手井内积水清理与抽水作业。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0323", "question": "临时抽水流水的综合单价是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 31.91420275156591, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "9278fc1fa10e15baa1de8ec1", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_3bc339b904b5be221ce9", "block_index": 219, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 219, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 49, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第220页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_891c9ec94d0c8af641f6", "page_number": 220, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_8b1abc03bbb47e41a7af", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_8b1abc03bbb47e41a7af", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第220页"], "section_title": "第220页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_3bc339b904b5be221ce9"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第220页