{"answer": "1. 站址业主维系回访与满意度调查的计量单位为“站·次”。[1]  \n2. 对应的综合单价为38.30元。[1]  \n3. 该费用包含人工费、管理费及利润。[1]  \n4. 项目编码为WH24103003。[1]  \n5. 适用于海拔2000米以下地区，特殊地区需调整系数。[4]", "case_id": "p6s-0330", "question": "在进行站址业主维系工作时，若需完成一次回访与满意度调查，对应的单位和综合单价是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 71.88100501700768, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "5ff993981f8c903c3752685e", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_dcb34b1598c0d767c671", "block_index": 290, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 290, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 64, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第291页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_6f2c7ce22412d2668974", "page_number": 291, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_3adad9f4c2fbe81ef58b", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_3adad9f4c2fbe81ef58b", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第291页"], "section_title": "第291页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_dcb34b1598c0d767c671"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "de