{"answer": "1. 敷设塑料线槽综合单价为64.65元/十米。[1]  \n2. 消耗量为0.38工日/十米。[1]  \n3. 不区分线槽宽度，按实际长度计列。[1]  \n4. 工作内容包括线槽检查、测位、安装及挫锐等。[1]  \n5. 计量单位为十米。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0332", "question": "敷设塑料线槽的作业，其综合单价和消耗量分别是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 40.042879608246594, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "755703e2be3f7e101dd7eccc", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_4ea10a520eb41b7333aa", "block_index": 326, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 326, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 72, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第327页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_f931e4e9be11708bcaef", "page_number": 327, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_c4203bdcc584f5d2a33b", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_c4203bdcc584f5d2a33b", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第327页"], "section_title": "第327页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_4ea10a520eb41b7333aa"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "ve