_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_53421ac01845ebf21899", "page_number": 180, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_8f1361fec987419f95a5", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_8f1361fec987419f95a5", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第180页"], "section_title": "第180页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_7d231b902b7ec64a57c7"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第180页 页码：180 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 174 表10.2.1.8 WH11008 直埋光缆日常检修 工作内容：培土，清除路由上的零星杂物；扶正标石、宣传牌、标志牌、警示牌；修补沟坎、堵塞、护坡、漫水坝、挡水墙等光缆保护措施；路由埋深探测等。 计量单位：千米²次 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH11008001 直埋光缆日常检修 平原 91.28 61.93 16.97 12.39 消耗量 0.43 0.21 WH11008002 城区、丘陵 109.54 74.31 20.36 14.86 0.51 0.26 WH11008003 山区 136.92 92.89 25.45 18.58 0.64 0.32 注：直埋硅芯管道及光缆视同直埋光缆，按直埋光缆条目取费。"}, "keyword_score": 0.14716901467345944, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.14716901467345944, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.5378539561038259, "score": 0.5378539561038259, "semantic_score": 0.705290359573983}, {"bm25_score": 12.935381205012408, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "d8dfa78cb9362f0d69cd659c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b6f247a411f750a786e9", "block_index": 342, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 342, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 60, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9fb82b1766911b54a376", "page_number": 343, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "section_title": "第343页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_b6f247a411f750a786e9"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第343页 页码：343 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 337 2）D.0.2 架空通信线路与其他建筑物的最小垂直净距表： 表 D.0.2 架空通信线路与其他建筑物的最小垂直净距表 架设高度(m) 备注 架设高度(m) 备注 市内街道 4.5 5.5 市内里弄 （胡同） 4.0 5.0 铁路 3.0 7.5 公路 3.0 5.5 土路 3.0 5 0.6 最低缆线到屋脊 1.5 最低缆线到房屋平顶 河流 - 1 最低缆线到最高水位时的船桅顶 市区树木 - 1.5 郊区树木 - 1.5 其他通信 导线 - 0.6 一方最低缆线到另一方最高线条 最低缆线到树枝的垂直距离 与线路方向平时时 与线路方向交越时 名称 最低缆线到 地面 房屋建筑物 - 最低缆线到轨面"}, "keyword_score": 0.13600590605564097, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.13600590605564097, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.532662274289839, "score": 0.532662274289839, "semantic_score": 0.702657860675924}]}
{"answer": "1. 直埋光缆与市外大树之间平行时最小净距为2米。[1]  \n2. 该数据来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第345页表D.0.4。[1]  \n3. 交越时无具体要求，仅标注为“-”。[1]  \n4. 市内、村镇大树的净距为0.75米，与市外大树不同。[1]  \n5. 维护时应严格遵循规程中规定的距离标准。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0337", "question": "在直埋光缆与树木（市外大树）之间，应保持的最小净距是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 62.97045004621228, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "fc09e131509365839af6116b", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_6fdc580ea7ee592dcec4", "block_index": 344, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 344, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 72, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第345页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_123605f020da8241e04a", "page_number": 345, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_1ba9d238a2817aaf87e2", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_1ba9d238a2817aaf87e2", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第345页"], "section_title": "第345页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_6fdc580ea7ee592dcec4"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第345页 页码：345 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 339 4）D.0.4 直埋光缆与其它建筑物及地下管线间最小净距： 表 D.0.4 直埋光缆与其它建筑物及地下管线间最小净距表 名称 平行时 交越时 通信管道边线（不包括人手孔） 0.75 0.25 非同沟的直埋通信光（电）缆 0.5 0.25 埋式电力电缆（交流35KV以下） 0.5 0.5 埋式电力电缆（交流36KV及以上） 2 0.5 给水管（管径小于300mm) 0.5 0.5 给水管（管径大于300mm～500mm) 1 0.5 给水管（管径大于500mm) 1.5 0.5 高压油管、天然气管 10 0.5 热力、排水管 1 0.5 燃气管（压力小于300KPa) 1 0.5 燃气管（压力300KPa及以上) 2 0.5 其他通信线路 0.5 - 排水沟 0.8 0.5 房屋建筑红线或基础 1 - 树木（市内、村镇大村、果树、行道树） 0.75 - 树木（市外大树） 2 - 水井、坟墓 3 - 粪坑、积肥池、沼气池、氨水池等 3 - 架空杆路及拉线 1.5 -"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.8674985370038195, "score": 0.8674985370038195, "semantic_score": 0.8107121957197423}, {"bm25_score": 25.17458120974387, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "d8dfa78cb9362f0d69cd659c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_b6f247a411f750a786e9", "block_index": 342, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 342, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 60, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_9fb82b1766911b54a376", "page_number": 343, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_e0c89cc6f3b2d520d0e8", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第343页"], "section_