{"answer": "1. 蓄电池容量试验包括放电、充电及测量记录等操作。[3]  \n2. 放电与充电应按规程进行，确保测试有效性。[3]  \n3. 测量记录需包含容量、电压、电流等关键数据。[3]  \n4. 试验后应进行清洁整理工作。[3]  \n5. 操作依据为24V以下蓄电池容量试验标准流程。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0351", "question": "在进行24V以下蓄电池容量试验时，应如何操作放电、充电及测量记录？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 57.67069696722776, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "2dd16c7ac2fac611ae6bf362", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_ea8594ffce9ae6bdbb7c", "block_index": 300, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 300, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 94, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第301页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_441ae4c7137c7ad3fbc0", "page_number": 301, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_4bca882746bd680d562d", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_4bca882746bd680d562d", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第301页"], "section_title": "第301页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_ea8594ffce9ae6bdbb7c"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", 