{"answer": "1. 山区环境监控设备巡检的项目编码是WH21112003。[1]  \n2. 该编码对应的工作内容包括检查清洁设备、测试告警功能等。[1]  \n3. 项目编码按地貌分类，山区为独立子项。[3]  \n4. 综合单价为21.89元/站·次。[1]  \n5. 项目编码在《电信基础设施维护规程》第238页有明确列出。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0355", "question": "环境监控设备巡检在山区的项目编码是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 40.298757643990946, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "f12012125369f531e5f278f8", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_a5c15fa6675b523ac850", "block_index": 237, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 237, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 57, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第238页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_13973274ceaa972b9a07", "page_number": 238, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_ecaa442033460d709402", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_ecaa442033460d709402", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第238页"], "section_title": "第238页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_a5c15fa6675b523ac850"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "te