{"answer": "1. 在拉线塔上安装小型化定向通信天线，技工人工费与利润之和为96.10元。[1]  \n2. 该费用对应项目编码WH23111011，适用于拉线塔（支撑杆、桅杆）上安装场景。[1]  \n3. 人工费包含技工与普工成本，利润部分已单独列示。[1]  \n4. 该单价为综合单价，含人工、管理费及利润。[1]  \n5. 若需其他高度或环境的报价，需参考对应分项。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0363", "question": "在拉线塔上安装小型化定向通信天线，其技工人工费与利润之和为多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 61.27681311941766, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "3f00969dea6d8d04c016cb97", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_cf36aa6c43c41209ccee", "block_index": 261, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 261, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 133, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第262页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_8101c18e1af958158799", "page_number": 262, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_aae3ee7bd846d2d7167b", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_aae3ee7bd846d2d7167b", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第262页"], "section_title": "第262页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_cf36aa6c43c41209ccee"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_rou