{"answer": "1. 检索结果中未提及“振动监测仪”的规格型号。[1]  \n2. 表格中列出的仪表均不包含“振动监测仪”。[1]  \n3. 无相关文档明确说明该仪器的规格型号。[1]  \n4. 建议补充具体设备信息或转人工查询。[1]  \n5. 当前知识库无法提供该问题的答案。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0367", "question": "机械仪表名称为‘振动监测仪’的规格型号是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 43.86261471507724, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "e38adab63c7209471e644981", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_592c4476615ee25aec71", "block_index": 160, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 160, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 92, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第161页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_b84a2ba2ec659774f38a", "page_number": 161, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_d4a041107e7ac45d67e0", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_d4a041107e7ac45d67e0", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第161页"], "section_title": "第161页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_592c4476615ee25aec71"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 