{"answer": "1. 维护分项作业名称含“光缆接头”的项目编码为WH12021。[3]  \n2. 该编码对应的工作内容包括挖、松填光缆沟及接头坑。[3]  \n3. 项目编码WH12021适用于光缆接头坑的开挖与回填作业。[3]  \n4. 光缆接头相关维护工作归类于挖填接头坑类项目。[3]  \n5. 项目编码WH12021在表10.2.2.21中明确列出。[3]", "case_id": "p6s-0368", "question": "维护分项作业名称中包含‘光缆接头’的项目编码是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 15.653712755128167, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "1e2c6562bfd3cc94176ca884", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_58d263c476f933008710", "block_index": 131, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 131, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 109, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第132页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_97cc0adf25682f04d456", "page_number": 132, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_ede7b28f39128b58bd5b", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_ede7b28f39128b58bd5b", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第132页"], "section_title": "第132页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_58d263c476f933008710"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8