{"answer": "1. 光纤熔接机在文档中列为“套”，未明确具体型号。[1]  \n2. 文档[2]提及“带状光纤熔接机”和“光纤熔接机”，但未给出具体型号。[2]  \n3. 文档[3]中“FTTH 熔接机”为名称，仍无具体型号信息。[3]  \n4. 所有文档均未提供“光纤熔接机”的确切规格型号。  \n5. 无法确定具体型号，建议补充厂家或设备标识信息。", "case_id": "p6s-0369", "question": "材料及备品备件名称中‘光纤熔接机’的规格型号是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 26.08205986190014, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "5a434183f374c6de2e84ef00", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_152489b21c384d0a5d1b", "block_index": 351, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 351, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["high_garbled_ratio", "table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 50, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第352页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_3fc8e887869f2505321a", "page_number": 352, "page_warning_codes": ["high_garbled_ratio", "table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_6be00873ab0a44b459c9", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_6be00873ab0a44b459c9", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第352页"], "section_title": "第352页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_152489b21c384d0a5d1b"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "tabl