{"answer": "1. 市区应急发电2小时以下综合单价为138.62元/次。[3]  \n2. 超过2小时后，每增加1小时费用为52.90元。[3]  \n3. 天馈系线系统故障抢修综合单价为156.86元/次。[2]  \n4. 发电费用按实际次数和时长计算，2小时起计。[1]  \n5. 故障抢修费用按实际发生次数计算，不按小时计费。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0373", "question": "市区基站发生天馈系线系统故障，需要进行应急发电且故障抢修，每小时发电费用和故障抢修费用分别是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 59.26987220390869, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "a7d5a112b0cfc93129f456ff", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f20fd322328273ae1718", "block_index": 141, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 141, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 61, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第142页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_a1c9f165e81c70c0f17c", "page_number": 142, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_0ef0a052f1750fd067aa", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_0ef0a052f1750fd067aa", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第142页"], "section_title": "第142页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_f20fd322328273ae1718"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第142页 页码：142 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 136 8.6.2.4 无线通信基站设备和设施其他维护项目 无线通信基站设备和设施其他维护项目。维护工作量清单项目设置及工作量计算规则，应按表8.6.2.4 的规定执行。 表8.6.2.4 无线通信基站设备和设施应急维护（编码：WH24） 项目编码 维护分项 作业名称 项目特征 计量单位 维护工作量计算规则 维护工作（操作）内容 WH24101 应急发电 ²地貌（平原、山 区、城区） ²发电时长 次 按实际发电次数和时长计算 注：时长以2 小时起计，超出2 小时部分按每增加1 小时单独 计算工日 1.器材准备 2.发电 3.恢复现场 4.记录发电时间 WH24102 故障抢修 ²地貌（平原、山 区、城区） ²故障类型 次 根据实际发生次数计算 1.天馈系统故障抢修。 2.主设备故障抢修。 3.配套设备故障抢修。 WH24103 其他维护 工作 ²地貌（平原、山 区、城区） ²工作项目 天²次 站²次 根据规程要求的操作方式和实 际发生次数计算 1.资产盘点、工程随工验 收、资源录入。 2.代缴电费 3.站址业主维系、业主满意 度调查。"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.7684206427711825, "score": 0.7684206427711825, "semantic_score": 0.669172346815975}, {"bm25_score": 51.905816827066616, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "b40a5f3233b8b9c86d387c6c", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f09a074c739c97964603", "block_index": 289, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 289, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 56, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第290页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_3adad9f4c2fbe81ef58b", "page_number": 290, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_9d21c0981ae4c911f364", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_9d21c0981ae4c911f364", "review_status": "app