{"answer": "1. 平原地区基站主设备故障时，需同时进行应急发电。[1]  \n2. 平原、2小时以下应急发电综合单价为167.81元/次。[2]  \n3. 超出2小时部分，每增加1小时加收52.90元。[2]  \n4. 应急发电包含器材准备、发电、恢复现场等操作。[2]  \n5. 综合单价按实际发电次数和时长计算。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0374", "question": "平原地区基站主设备故障时，是否需要同时进行应急发电，其综合单价各是多少？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 37.1187196708201, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "a7d5a112b0cfc93129f456ff", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_f20fd322328273ae1718", "block_index": 141, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 141, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 61, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第142页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_a1c9f165e81c70c0f17c", "page_number": 142, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_0ef0a052f1750fd067aa", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_0ef0a052f1750fd067aa", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第142页"], "section_title": "第142页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_f20fd322328273ae1718"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d86900