{"answer": "1. 控制箱开关频繁跳闸，需由专业人员带电更换空开。[1]  \n2. 更换操作应遵循带电更换熔断器/空开规范流程。[1]  \n3. 严禁非专业人员擅自操作，确保作业安全。[1]  \n4. 建议上报系统派单，由持证人员处理。[1]  \n5. 操作前应确认设备状态并做好防护措施。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0377", "question": "控制箱里那个开关老是跳，想换个新的，怎么操作？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 5.234522227189318, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "3fcd612549a4e58e909deb0e", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_30e9ef90c6a91003028a", "block_index": 305, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 305, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 62, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第306页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_b4400c6fa1550a7ad00e", "page_number": 306, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_15bf63cad9f641df2a83", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_15bf63cad9f641df2a83", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第306页"], "section_title": "第306页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_30e9ef90c6a91003028a"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施