{"answer": "1. 宽带障碍处理的工单计量单位为“工单²条”。[1]  \n2. 该计量单位用于按实计列维护工作量。[2]  \n3. 工单²条是表8.6.4.4中明确规定的计量方式。[2]  \n4. 项目编码WH44101对应障碍处理，计量单位为工单²条。[1]  \n5. 该单位在维护分项作业中统一使用。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0384", "question": "宽带障碍处理的工单计量单位是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 37.96358991269336, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "ba10f2779266d60fb65e5b8b", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_274b15a4c140bfc5d3fa", "block_index": 337, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "工单流转", "chunk_index": 337, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 41, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第338页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_266c6d2d50a01903867e", "page_number": 338, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_c6d9755c25f701f917cd", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_c6d9755c25f701f917cd", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第338页"], "section_title": "第338页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_274b15a4c140bfc5d3fa"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第338页 页码：338 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 332 10.5.4 宽带障碍处理项目综合单价指标 表10.5.4.1 WH44101 障碍处理 工作内容：工单信息确认，器材准备、确定障碍原因、障碍维修、业务恢复确认、障碍回单等。 计量单位：工单²条 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH44101001 障碍处理 32.34 21.94 6.01 4.39 消耗量 0.19 —"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.8023491379798522, "score": 0.8023491379798522, "semantic_score": 0.7176416256855032}, {"bm25_score": 33.66396250476496, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "206d11a37b452206c3d2fc95", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_22b59fcf2f74c7cd9af4", "block_index": 155, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 155, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 79, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第156页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_3085902e4b4957158254", "page_number": 156, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_333244c89c00c3c08242", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_333244c89c00c3c08242", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第156页"], "section_title": "第156页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_22b59fcf2f74c7cd9af4"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第156页 页码：156 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 150 8.6.4.4 宽带障碍处理 宽带障碍处理。维护工作量清单项目设置及工作量计算规则，应按表8.6.4.4 的规定执行。 表8.6.4.4 宽带障碍处理（编码：WH44） 项目编码 维护分项 作业名称 项目特征 计量单位 维护工作量计算规则 维护工作（操作）内容 WH44101 障碍处理 工单²条 按实计列 1.工单信息确认 2.器材准备 3.确定障碍原因、障碍维修 4.障碍回单 8.6.5 电信基础设施维护工作措施清单项目（ 编码 CS100000 ） 电信基础设施维护工作措施清单项目设置、计量单位及工作量计算规则，应按表8.6.5 的规定执行。 表8.6.5 电信基础设施维护工作措施项目（编码：CS00） 项目编码 项目名称 计量 单位 工作内容及包含范围 CS00001 文明施工费 项 指维护现场为达到环保要求及文明作业所需要的各项费用。 CS00002 维护干扰费 项 指维护作业中由于受市政管理、交通管制、人流密集、现场协调等影响 工效的补偿费用。在城区、高速公路隔离带、铁路路基边缘作业的维护 项目计取此项费用。 CS00003 车辆使用费 项 指维护作业中接送维护作业人员、生活用车等（含过路、过桥）费用。 CS00004 维护资料更新、器材清点费 项 指按规定编制、更新维护资料和器材点交等所发生的费用 CS00005 维护站点设施费 项 指维护企业为进行维护作业必须设置的生活和生产用建筑物、构筑物和 其他临时设施费用等 CS00006 夜间维护作业增加费 项 指因夜间维护作业所发生的补助费、工效降低、照明设备摊销及照明用 电等费用。 CS00007 冬雨季维护作业增加费 项 指冬雨季维护作业所采取的防冻、保温、防雨防滑等安全措施及工效降 低所增加的费用。室内作业的维护项目不计此项费用。 CS00008 生产工具用具使用费 项 指维护作业所需的不属于固定资产的工具用具等的购置、摊销、维修费。"}, "keyword_score": 0.8867433923447058, "normalized_bm25_score": 0.8867433923447058, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.7379493177478478, "score": 0.7379493177478478, "semantic_score": 0.6741804286349087}, {"bm25_score": 25.567099806687757, "chunk": {"document_id": "5256824b6b72b3f03d9c7a2c", "id": "1c317b1dd2cebfbf9647d03e", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_e4bef2211b5bd8cddc76", "block_index": 11, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 11, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "dcf78195a87f01f45fc99b3af1c541f948a7cc8b6578168c0cb862cf9b620277", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 4, "end_unit": 96, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "fi